{"time": 1760894280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244740181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我甚至点了神秘学）"}
{"time": 1760894428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879533109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=591112993]俗话说一日之计在于晨，反正都醒来了，去附近无人的林子里练习练习魔法吧"}
