{"time": 1760899662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309079155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（反正你们都是1级）"}
{"time": 1760899669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005737773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "毕竟提着肉不敢跑太快"}
{"time": 1760899680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1894972271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd"}
{"time": 1760899680, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1894972271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[莉维娅]演奏出: 1D20=13"}
{"time": 1760899735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943879053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在前面遥遥领先，看了看身后适当放慢脚步，最后停下来等他一起，心情倒是好了很多"}
{"time": 1760899751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938940713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1995567416](诶，那我就要说青梅打不过天降了)"}
{"time": 1760899789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571807594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉..跑的好快啊”有一点点喘，毕竟自己也不是这种力量型的"}
{"time": 1760899877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335018819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，还没吃过早餐的你们俩追跑着穿过大街。即便有青春力量加持，这会也有些头重脚轻。好在最后也没撞上人。"}
{"time": 1760899972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "197403969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是不是伊恩长期不锻炼的原因?\"得意地抱起手，\"好了，到家。\"拿出钥匙开门，\"肉放在盐水里，等等我...\"噔噔噔跑进自己的房间。"}
{"time": 1760900033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084095478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1571807594]你也不是第一次来舒茉家，自然也知道厨房在哪"}
{"time": 1760900068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352583412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=197403969]床铺还没收拾，不过有一股淡淡的阳光气息"}
{"time": 1760900110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189278570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去到厨房接一盆水，把肉放里面泡着，然后加几勺盐"}
{"time": 1760900264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832934046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=352583412]留恋地摸一摸被子，收拾好床铺，到自己的桌前看看早上没带出去的日记本"}
{"time": 1760900264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21097273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（伊神呢）"}
{"time": 1760900275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102418775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(打字ing)"}
{"time": 1760900301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383252920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后去院子里等舒茉"}
{"time": 1760900379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242333643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1832934046]日记本不知什么时候翻到了第一页……它总是在第一页。上面有看似无规则的线条浮现，随即又隐没，留不下印象，但你总觉得那些东西有意义"}
{"time": 1760900480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942326371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，自己一直很笨，从来就弄不明白这个日记本。合上它带着下楼去院子里找伊恩"}
{"time": 1760900706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683367463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "正好有人从舒茉家的后院里扛着东西出来，沿着你们回来的方向。一头金色短发，身形健壮而不夸张，你们都认识他——肯特·韦伯，村口老护卫的儿子，长你们两岁，扛着一筐装得满满当当的木炭。显然看到了你们，努努嘴和你们打了个招呼。不过今天的他有些不一样"}
{"time": 1760900751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108398125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩，看样子没等太久。\"笑嘻嘻，看着他在院子，手指点着自己的下巴，\"吃过早饭吗？不急的话，在我家先吃...\"正说着对着韦伯招招手，\"肯特哥，早上好。\""}
{"time": 1760900756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743111094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早上好啊，肯特”"}
{"time": 1760900773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167516609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他穿着一身油光锃亮的皮甲，那身皮甲伊恩在他家见过，曾经摆在客厅的展示柜里"}
{"time": 1760900816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065343308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好帅...你怎么把它穿上了”"}
{"time": 1760900912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945238561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“早”肯特简单开口，有些微喘“你们刚从商路那边回来？我么，今天老爹说打算带我去前线那边看看，有机会的话，打算在那边入伍了”"}
{"time": 1760900937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149817790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，找工作）"}
{"time": 1760900941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20781146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好恐怖的话题）"}
{"time": 1760900953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1647485171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好厉害...”有些羡慕肯特已经规划好了自己的未来"}
{"time": 1760901061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946132839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...肯特哥要走了吗？\"有些惊讶，自己早就习惯不变的日常，\"真厉害啊。\"但还是下意识贺喜。"}
{"time": 1760901094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299186197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎，我是觉得自己还没准备好。但我爹偏说我已经比他年轻的时候厉害了。”*他也有些哭笑不得“总之，这框木炭我先帮叔叔搬过去了，再见”"}
{"time": 1760901137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454984396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头，\"真羡慕大家可以去很多很远的地方。\"手指卷着自己的头发，目送着他走远，小声喃喃自语，\"舒茉...可能一直会待在这里...\""}
{"time": 1760901177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111189503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（并非很远（）"}
{"time": 1760901229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51296914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "挥手告别"}
{"time": 1760901297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425358311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "为自己迷茫的未来叹口气"}
{"time": 1760901300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536873037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(其实算远啦，对于没出过门的女孩子)"}
{"time": 1760901355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624616254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是）"}
{"time": 1760901358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341449872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（少年派）"}
{"time": 1760901372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855065892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "侧目盯着伊恩，心里想着像伊恩这样会魔法的人，迟早也会去更远的地方...心中难免有些苦涩，低着头自顾自闷着，不开口。"}
{"time": 1760901381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058287578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，事业有成的老大哥）"}
{"time": 1760901434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683921012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，早饭是舒茉做的吗”转移话题，不想氛围继续这么沉重下去"}
{"time": 1760901490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339010175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（显然不是（）"}
{"time": 1760901581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082688409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "收回自己盯着的视线，连转着背过身掩饰表情，\"不是啦，我不会做饭...\""}
{"time": 1760901642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101469351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"咳...伊恩去吃早餐吧。\"平稳一下呼吸，抬腿往后院走，\"我去那边看一下，很快回来。\""}
{"time": 1760901681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301925873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉你早上吃了？”"}
{"time": 1760901705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337604241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "早饭是加了些许动物油脂和肉碎菌类熬的粥，或者说米糊。咸鲜可口，喝完感觉暖烘烘的"}
{"time": 1760901745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440597854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉喝完之后舒服多了，之前空腹跑步确定有些难受"}
{"time": 1760901949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354246711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一个人在后院转转，缓解一下心情。但还是忍不住会想刚刚想的东西，愈发烦躁。找一个角落坐下，捧着脸皱眉。"}
{"time": 1760902025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678905624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2101469351]后院堆着不少木料，有的已经去了皮，在阳光下排开，没怎么堆叠，切面处有好看的花纹。有的则杂乱地堆在一起，不远处有一根插着大斧头的木桩，木桩旁边则是一口烧炭用的炉子"}
{"time": 1760902128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849686562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "找一处比较高的木材堆，坐在后面。没什么胃口，干脆再翻一翻日记本，等伊恩找过来。"}
{"time": 1760902172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358990389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "吃完之后洗下碗，就去找舒茉了"}
{"time": 1760902204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860991449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在看那本魔法书吗？”"}
{"time": 1760902301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718439975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=849686562]此时后院空无一人，只有一只松鼠在倒塌的木材堆里穿行翻找，毛茸茸的大尾巴比本体显眼得多。而已经翻开的日记本除了无法忘却的本体以外……关于它的一切都如同一片被波纹搅得波光粼粼的湖面"}
{"time": 1760902364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23538368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "什么都不看出来，听见伊恩的话合上日记，\"魔法书?\"努努嘴，心情看上去就不太好，\"普通的日记本，女孩子的秘密，伊恩不准偷看。\""}
{"time": 1760902476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1241833552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起＞人＜”双手合十道个歉，坐在她的身旁，双手撑着，然后后仰看天“舒茉还在想肯特的事情吗”"}
{"time": 1760902601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319398347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"深深思考了一会，轻轻咳两下，摇头，\"伊恩的话，迟早会离开未白吧?\"不去看他，低头看着脚下的泥土"}
{"time": 1760902767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748211150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“会吗，我也不知道啊”看着天上的云朵发出感叹"}
{"time": 1760902810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "752775080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥）"}
{"time": 1760902818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734424798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你那个键盘怎么调光效来着）"}
{"time": 1760902828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000131793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（算了我把线拔了就行）"}
{"time": 1760902836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467663667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（fn加方向键）"}
{"time": 1760902850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896559133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（方向键的左右还是上下来着）"}
{"time": 1760902868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995235828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你的脑海中闪过些许七彩的洪流，像阳光下流动的水雾……似乎杂糅在一起，主视角并不难猜，不是伊恩便是你自己，踏出村庄的次数寥寥无几。有些事你没经历过，但是有所耳闻，并不算新奇"}
{"time": 1760902910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917708985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一辈子待在这里也没什么不好的吧，仅仅是这样想着，就感觉胸口似乎隐隐作痛"}
{"time": 1760902939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993103396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "捂着脑袋怔怔出神，没有回伊恩的话，沉浸在自己脑海中的记忆里。"}
{"time": 1760903089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991538570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(等翔哥喊醒，jpg)"}
{"time": 1760903095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663581195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你的记忆自然不会陌生，但你似乎能记得起，自己尚在襁褓中的时光。那时候父母都还很年轻，说不定比你现在也没大几岁。而伊恩……则恰恰相反，他的记忆，最早也在七八岁之后"}
{"time": 1760903135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314269909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "更年幼的样子，你翻遍了也没有找到那种印象"}
{"time": 1760903194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "158148157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉，舒茉？”回过头来看她，好像在发呆一样，手在她前面晃晃"}
{"time": 1760903269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813076921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "怎么会找不到?不信邪，拿出势必要找到的劲头，沉得更深，想去窥探伊恩最开始的样子。于是更加出神，根本没在意伊恩的呼喊"}
{"time": 1760903468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "213729732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "也许是在想什么很重要的事情，那就不打扰她了，静静坐在她身边"}
{"time": 1760903530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301807513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "斑斓的影子上浮，像礼炮里塞的碎纸。你执意下沉，往更深处探寻……四周却越来越暗、越来越冷。话语声消失了，你却忍不住捂住耳朵……你突然觉得被什么托住，片刻后亮度重新饱满起来，你才意识到自己刚刚忘了呼吸"}
{"time": 1760903655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350831337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=213729732]你却觉得，周围有一瞬间的安静。飞鸟的鸣叫与振翅、松鼠穿过枝叶的窸窣、水车吱呀转动的声音……都迟滞了一瞬，在那一瞬间，只有你的心跳声格外明显"}
{"time": 1760903706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842828089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "大口呼吸起来，从这种感觉中脱出，\"咳...咳。\"一边攥紧自己的胸口一边喘气，\"伊...恩，你...还在吗？\"低头看着脚下的泥土，有种强烈的眩晕感"}
{"time": 1760903797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917981543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃....嗯”忽然听到舒茉的声音，感觉有点被吓到，不过很快就缓了过来“在的，舒茉刚刚在想什么啊，那么专心”"}
{"time": 1760903874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939350033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(就不能先抱抱，已经又喘又晕了)"}
{"time": 1760903924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222618848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（先抱抱是？）"}
{"time": 1760903931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131632490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "显然顾不上回话，但是听到回话安心下来，\"没...没什么...\"捂着脑袋，想克制那股眩晕感。"}
{"time": 1760903932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "236176091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看她的样子，拍拍她的后背"}
{"time": 1760903947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978389015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(夸张的修辞手法，先表态吧)"}
{"time": 1760903996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818246449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你怎么了..怎么看起来不太好样子，我带你去看医生吧..还能走吗，要不我背你？”"}
{"time": 1760904063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391495100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"轻...轻点...\"随后摇头，\"...休息一会，我...\"说话的同时喘个不停，\"没...事...\""}
{"time": 1760904154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "185677792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你这怎么样也不像没事的样子吧”跳下来，然后背对着舒茉半蹲下“上来，我带你去诊所”"}
{"time": 1760904252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126306987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"虽然想过再拒绝，但是最后还是乖巧地趴到他的背上，紧紧攥紧他的手袖，调整自己的呼吸。"}
{"time": 1760904356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428472339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "稳稳的背上舒茉，带她去诊所"}
{"time": 1760904371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109912979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "蓝色的鬓发落在你的后颈，有些说不出的瘙痒。而裙子不像裤装有硬度，一旦受到外力就会忠实地反应触感"}
{"time": 1760904540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041946302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我们的卫兵哥是不是该有立绘的）"}
{"time": 1760904557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583116462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可以有吧)"}
{"time": 1760904557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938296648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "脸有些微微发红，一时不知道该说些什么...不对不对，现在看医生才是最重要的，努力不去想杂七杂八的"}
{"time": 1760904644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460794508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=0B17C218A7A9972F72BCBECCE37A29B1.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQuPLteBt9mOfG_Iz8q4PDoHDcKtBjyjhcg_woo59bn_YixkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ73Mdy6nDnHBLvBASG4S803oC41uCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMJuwSurm1U2ZFuJ2F6WNcwJlnSSNfQP3zuybZZaAc4xmlHWwhH9ohzmO_bZcQG20Jg,file_size=378738]"}
{"time": 1760904647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755371632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说是这位（）"}
{"time": 1760904669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783294522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你知道的，我很少存男图）"}
{"time": 1760904685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502310796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一路都尽量保持安静，微微把脑袋靠近一些，搭在他的后背上，自己也有些安心，虽然依然有些喘息压抑不住，但是隔着衣服的话...伊恩应该也感觉不到...?"}
{"time": 1760904710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173234293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=783294522](理解的，因为我也几乎不存)"}
{"time": 1760904724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275656003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我会说男法也没比女法高（）"}
{"time": 1760904837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470334539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "诊所不算远，人一如既往地少，里头连医生带护士带保洁带前台加在一起一共两个人。其中一人黑发白衣，另一人则是棕发绿衣"}
{"time": 1760904896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1192467064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒莱忽然感觉很不舒服，可以帮她看看吗，医生”"}
{"time": 1760904921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585635498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说一个是牧师一个是德鲁伊你信吗（）"}
{"time": 1760904933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971810663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好吧，其实一个是魔法侧一个是科学侧）"}
{"time": 1760904936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351640666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1760904952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519607477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我知道谁魔法谁科技了)"}
{"time": 1760904968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244940922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说是这么说，但是）"}
{"time": 1760904978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420062544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我会说不是白大褂（）"}
{"time": 1760905118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224752148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1760905120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712974373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么个不舒服？”*穿绿衣服的女士站起来，帮着把舒茉放在椅子上。一旁一副圣职者打扮的女性则十指交握，淡淡的荧光亮起"}
{"time": 1760905158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221015412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "被光芒笼罩的你们都感觉呼吸顺畅平缓了些"}
{"time": 1760905222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016481005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "和舒茉分开后松了一口气，但又有一点点舍不得...忽然有扇自己的冲动，这种时候了怎么还在想奇奇怪怪的事情"}
{"time": 1760905273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839818936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "呼吸平缓之后总算开口能顺畅了一些，\"刚刚...好像不能呼吸...好冷...好暗...\"捂着胸口有些后怕"}
{"time": 1760905442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406228263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯嗯……”绿衣服的那个抓住了你的手腕，两根手指压在你的静脉上“没有发热，也没有贫血不在生理期。突然性的？之前有过吗？”"}
{"time": 1760905557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482120003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么四点半了）"}
{"time": 1760905573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888236613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么四点半了)"}
{"time": 1760905618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1021548336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1406228263]\"之前...\"此前倒也窥探过记忆，不过没有这一次的反应激烈，摇头，\"没有...就是刚刚...\""}
{"time": 1760905691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1849807833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“医生，舒茉有事吗”有些担心"}
{"time": 1760905707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793998925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=F41A526C2C6BD80ECAB229C2DF5309E2.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTeCnsIw1qnJZ71Dzk7fHOYxJdnzBj3gmsg_woohfi8-IyxkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQfKaQ09Xm6C9WlMLPn4Bg7XoCrJGCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMNGeIb5vbutpEtmcdLHknlxvBYDoyNbG3QV-lOqiRU6OmWseFAIQE4Ndt9KCFz0yuw,file_size=1753463]"}
{"time": 1760905714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013996590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这身真好看吧）"}
{"time": 1760905790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138240113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我去，这么好看)"}
{"time": 1760905957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "936463287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”她松开手，一旁的牧师则翻开一本厚重的带书角的经卷，上面的文字亮起光来。她一手捧着书，一手伸向舒茉的额头，温暖的金光让你不自觉闭上了眼。那股被淹没的不适感消失了，如同湖水被蒸腾成雾气\n“嗯……应该没事了？”她收回手，声音里带着些安慰“没有诅咒的气息，可能是最近有些积郁。要多想想开心的事哦”"}
{"time": 1760906007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332429642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（过完这段睡）"}
{"time": 1760906053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733716009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好。\"乖巧地开口，\"谢谢牧师姐姐...\"沉下心缓缓吐出口气，\"伊恩，背我回去。\""}
{"time": 1760906071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116054116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢，谢谢”听到没事悬着的心彻底放下了“姐姐，要付多少钱...”"}
{"time": 1760906100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765227664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好问题，总感觉上次付钱还是在上次）"}
{"time": 1760906146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616172592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=733716009][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “好吧，都依你”摸摸舒茉的头，然后拿出一直以来攒的钱"}
{"time": 1760906189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045104859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我付啦。\"拍拍他的手臂，\"姐姐?\""}
