{"time": 1760906453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437082092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1045104859]“呀，真是公事公办呢。不过要是其他人和叶梦也和你一样就好了”绿衣服的医生瞥了一眼一旁的圣职者，接着开口到“5银币”"}
{"time": 1760906500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881302272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然有点草率。但是先按1信用→20银币算吧）"}
{"time": 1760906570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327058389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "递出银币，拉拉伊恩的袖子，\"走。\""}
{"time": 1760906632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438245969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她接过舒茉的银币，坐回了自己的位子。“慢走”"}
{"time": 1760906640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838974619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧..”既然舒茉要付就依她了，小心的背起舒茉，然后与两位姐姐告别"}
{"time": 1760906698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404995478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "离开诊所，朝舒茉家前去“舒茉今天还是回去休息吧...”"}
{"time": 1760906813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889093773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "心里想着刚刚的事情，还是有些闷闷的，听完他的话轻轻叹口气，\"...\""}
{"time": 1760906863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422674602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"吃完早餐，我再休息。\"最后吐出这么句话"}
{"time": 1760907041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585407735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "此时气氛变得稍微轻松了一些，又开始了胡思乱想起来“呃..嗯..”思绪忽然被打断，有些不知道该怎么接，有一点点尴尬，缓缓的背着舒茉回去，不过心里还是有点开心的，走的慢慢的，希望这样的时间可以稍微长一些"}
{"time": 1760907059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075731413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你还记得你们一开始是要干什么吗.jpg）"}
