{"time": 1760987363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004308787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "林间绿意盎然，但不会单调。此时不如春季花团锦簇，颜色鲜艳得像要撑破眼眶，但各类野果挂在林间，青涩而诱人。而野草莓却是正当季"}
{"time": 1760987420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208271009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（真的绿意盎然吗）"}
{"time": 1760987435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249098569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(早秋跟夏天有什么区别)"}
