{"time": 1760987546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791060312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摘点野草莓，擦一擦递给舒茉“尝尝，看看甜不甜”"}
