{"time": 1760988171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012822359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抱着浆果，一边随意地掂起几颗塞进嘴里，一边随意地开口，\"刚刚在家里的时候的问题，要给我老老实实回答。\"说着话回头瞪一眼伊恩，\"是不是最好吃的啦?\""}
{"time": 1760988226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636665165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "哑然失笑“舒茉家的饭菜最好吃了”"}
{"time": 1760988295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854350357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "林叶的翠绿间突然冒出一抹不和谐的泥黄色，被舒茉的余光捕捉到……当然不是地面。那家伙不算太大，不过比松鼠大得多。在灌木间穿行，却几乎没怎么发出声音"}
{"time": 1760988309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193126812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（猫妖？）"}
{"time": 1760988326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2113839184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（gbl太邪恶了）"}
{"time": 1760988334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842056387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不就只有，猫妖了）"}
{"time": 1760988426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1956869883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有动静。\"停下脚步，往伊恩旁边靠一靠"}
{"time": 1760988472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1397641231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "顺着舒茉的目光看过去“小心点”把舒茉护在身后，如临大敌"}
{"time": 1760988515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716392008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有什么东西在灌木里...\"顿时有些不安，不会是什么怪物吧...自己没有见过那些东西...\"我们快走...伊恩...\"有些腿抖，怀里的浆果有些滚落在地上"}
{"time": 1760988587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848972071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别怕...我会保护好你的，不要把后背留给它...”带着舒茉缓缓后退"}
{"time": 1760988679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300115065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（db是什么？）"}
{"time": 1760988687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956935658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "灌木间响起一阵吱吱声，一只老鼠慌忙跳出来，下一瞬，土黄的利爪探出，轻易刺穿了老鼠的侧腰……那似乎是一只猫，至少低伏着的体态很像。头颈处的毛发很长，像一顶斗篷，遮住它那丑陋狰狞的面部……"}
{"time": 1760988695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331998214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我会说那时候我没想好）"}
{"time": 1760988704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007293257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（反正你也不会拿拳头）"}
{"time": 1760988708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689298551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（用到了再说）"}
