{"time": 1760990654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820343509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "手臂受伤对准头果然还是有一些影响，冷静，对面已经是强弩之末了，别慌..."}
{"time": 1760990690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1646865246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你的攻击没有命中，但猫妖吃了大亏，好像也不打算和你纠缠。它叼起先前的可怜老鼠，往灌木丛里钻"}
{"time": 1760990756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332294437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“快走”顾不得那么多了，直接把瘫坐在地上的舒茉抱起来，带她往村子里跑"}
{"time": 1760990913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406024213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没有东西追上来，甚至飞鸟的声音也并无停歇。发生在林间的事暂时还无人在意"}
{"time": 1760990917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625369361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...\"绷紧之后突然放松下来的现在，在刺鼻的血腥味中，身体感到了前所未有的疲劳，不由得抓紧伊恩的身体，脸上泪痕和新添的泪水交错在一起，还是说不出什么成片的话"}
{"time": 1760991094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528002784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没事...的，已经安全了..”手臂本身就有伤，虽然舒茉不是很重，但还是不太好受"}
{"time": 1760991167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423533939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "林间的雾气不知何时弥漫开来，阳光也照不透。氤氲的氛围有些让人恍惚。为什么在奔跑，为什么在哭泣？伊恩感觉身体轻巧了些，血似乎止住了"}
{"time": 1760991238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "517836408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "为什么如此慌乱？好像……舒茉发现自己有些记不清了，刚刚发生了什么？似乎是不太好的事情"}
{"time": 1760991271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1864678589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我...\"有些疑惑为什么自己泪流满面，还被抱在怀里，\"...伊恩，为什么抱着我?咦...我为什么...在哭?\"手指抚过自己的脸颊"}
{"time": 1760991289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230237440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是长夜月发力了）"}
{"time": 1760991306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890053262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我两都记不得了还是只有她）"}
{"time": 1760991317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611447101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（都）"}
{"time": 1760991337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1304955618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你只记得自己在逃跑，因为要逃跑……但总感觉缺了点原因"}
{"time": 1760991347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252156899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也...不太记得了...为什么我会抱着舒茉..”"}
{"time": 1760991365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769638741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "急忙把她放下来“对不起...”"}
{"time": 1760991388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733555772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（衣服又没补好）"}
{"time": 1760991422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156237078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能抱着舒茉太有冲击力了（）"}
{"time": 1760991498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1248802943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像？我们是在逃跑吗？”记得不太清楚了，然后才注意到自己胳膊上好像有一排牙印"}
{"time": 1760991502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648590577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩...！你怎么受伤了。\"看着他的肩膀，\"刚刚摔了吗？\"发觉记忆越发模糊，\"刚刚...到底怎么了?\"捂着头"}
{"time": 1760991533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454497895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1248802943]（肩膀）"}
{"time": 1760991546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691648532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "毫无疑问，遇上了什么危险的事情……结果就在眼前，只有过程记不清了"}
{"time": 1760991592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799645086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己也完全记不清何时起了大雾，\"呃...这里肯定有什么问题，伊恩...我们快回去。\"拉起他的手，虽然完全没有头绪，但只有一件事毫无疑问，跑起来"}
{"time": 1760991681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590631671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好痛..“嗯....”跟着舒茉一起跑起来，这里很奇怪，不能待在这里，在忍一会就好了..."}
{"time": 1760991810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830802266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们没跑太远，回村自然也没花什么功夫。雾散得更快……回过神来，阳光下的村落就在眼前了"}
{"time": 1760991884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138931249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好奇怪，今天天气这么好，下午为什么会起雾呢，不过没出什么事就好，松了一口气"}
{"time": 1760992011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038312609", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "肩膀虽然还有一点点痛，不过舒茉没事就好"}
{"time": 1760992056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144894303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一点？）"}
{"time": 1760992072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092446723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "肩膀虽然非常痛，不过舒茉没事就好"}
{"time": 1760992092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706334670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "停下脚步仔细检查一下伊恩衣服破损的地方，\"血止住了?\"完全想不清楚刚刚发生的事情，\"头痛...伊恩还疼吗？\""}
{"time": 1760992218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675516822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "痛觉残留"}
{"time": 1760992350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332058605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“一点点啦，舒茉不用担心了”努力挤出笑容看向舒茉，不过....视线聚焦到和舒茉牵起的手，脸唰的一下红了"}
{"time": 1760992378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781137937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今天果然不应该出门...对不起...对不起...\"另一只手在胸前紧攥，语气沮丧至极，\"都是我的错...我不该拉着伊恩出门的。\""}
{"time": 1760992420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135159772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不怪舒茉了，应该是我自己太笨，在哪的擦伤吧”虽然看起来似乎完全不像是擦伤"}
{"time": 1760992554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938778647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是死亡之舞）"}
{"time": 1760992565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823289898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（把一次性惊吓满满结算吗）"}
{"time": 1760992579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "74607150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（慢慢）"}
{"time": 1760992580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572334394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "被这么说眼睛又红了些，扭头不让他看掉下来的眼泪，\"去神官姐姐那里吧...\"拉着他走，\"我会照顾...伊恩...\"吸着鼻子"}
{"time": 1760992585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741519480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "嘴上虽然这样说着，但注意力完全在和舒茉牵手这件事上，感觉心里有些悸动，舒茉似乎也比平常看起来更漂亮了“不要..自责啦”有些不好意思继续看舒茉了，把头移开，盯着其他地方"}
{"time": 1760992615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697404636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(被吓得半死唉，16岁的小女孩)"}
{"time": 1760992767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754324191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1572334394]“嗯..去看看吧..应该没什么大事”掏出纸帮她擦擦眼泪“好了，别哭了”"}
{"time": 1760992816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725798591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该睡觉了）"}
