{"time": 1761044254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "293889809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "过去把衣服取下来“医生姐姐再见”说完感觉哪里好像怪怪的..."}
{"time": 1761044347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211000865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1039508137]“自己拿咯，不过我看你不穿不也走得正大光明？”\n医生被牧师拱了一下，这才收起调侃的语气“不过破了好几条口子，还沾着血。来都来了，干脆穿个病号服再走吧”"}
{"time": 1761044483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941517632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=294902086]仔细检查自己的身体各处，拿热水拂过身体，\"舒茉已经有些想不清楚了...\"随后缓缓把自己放进热水里，\"...好累...\""}
{"time": 1761044570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431379313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1211000865][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “谢谢姐姐...我过几天会把衣服还回来的”"}
{"time": 1761044653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275257238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1941517632]即便现在是早秋，热水依旧能蒸腾起雾气……水雾中闪过一些昏黄的影子，比你早上看见过的暗淡得多"}
{"time": 1761044754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381635572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=431379313]她懒得回你，朝一边墙上挂着的一排衣服努了努嘴"}
{"time": 1761044824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998669385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感激的拿一件穿上，然后一只手拿着自己的衣服，另一只手挥手告别“姐姐再见👋🏻”"}
{"time": 1761044839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553922016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小跑去舒茉的家里"}
{"time": 1761044864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101889885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些出神，伸出手尝试捞起那些蒸腾的雾气，\"虽然知道不会有回答...雾...舒茉该怎么做...\"随后把下半张脸浸泡在水里吐泡泡，同时闭上眼"}
{"time": 1761044902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450762258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1998669385]“以后少来——”你听见医生拉长的社畜音"}
{"time": 1761045127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110532050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2101889885]或许是因为现在尤为安定，雾气里的模糊画面愿意清晰起来……那是一副定格画，森林里，与村中养的毛茸茸的可爱萌物相去甚远的妖怪跃起，尖爪闪着寒光，面部依旧一片模糊，在灯光中只留下光晕。"}
{"time": 1761045153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "86819775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1450762258][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “嗯....”但是总有一种以后会经常来的感觉"}
{"time": 1761045371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834931417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2110532050]\"...怪物...\"身处家里的热水之中依然感到了慌乱，\"不要...\"下意识后仰"}
{"time": 1761045423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "122628597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一头跌入了水中，狠狠吸了一大口热水，随即剧烈咳嗽起来，同时伴随着在水中挣扎的声音。"}
{"time": 1761045456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085007192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（何意呢）"}
{"time": 1761045523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496166258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(吓！)"}
{"time": 1761045566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312067423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小跑去舒茉家里蹭晚饭"}
{"time": 1761045609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125637043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（关着门，听不见）"}
{"time": 1761045648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87579182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（在自己家浴缸淹死？）"}
{"time": 1761045726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462249244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那很)"}
{"time": 1761045729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981747363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(丢人了)"}
{"time": 1761045797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523079670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "它当然不会动，只是悬在那里，像一张画片。面对着它的是惊慌失措的你自己和勉强着自己的伊恩。画面没有因为入水而消散，反倒慢慢流转起来。你看见一颗萦绕着寒气的冰球被伊恩射出去，妖怪落荒而逃"}
{"time": 1761045915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110944693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我骑个车）"}
{"time": 1761046037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369429861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1523079670]\"呼...呼...\"慢慢平息下自己的呼吸，\"你想告诉我...当时发生的事情...\"逐渐找回了那时的记忆，\"...\"抱着双腿坐在水中，心中莫名的感觉翻涌，像是哀叹什么都做不到的自己，又像是悲伤着什么，\"我还是...什么都做不到...靠着你和伊恩保护...\""}
{"time": 1761046045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1971325861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说桶哪有那么大，收着膝盖才能坐下去的地方到底要怎么淹）"}
{"time": 1761046201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413550749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我以为能平坐下去)"}
{"time": 1761046217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822965984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(浴缸大小)"}
{"time": 1761046235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496592421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（浴缸也淹不死人啊）"}
{"time": 1761046239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800716262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又不是池子）"}
{"time": 1761046264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398701909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "画面慢慢消散，在雾气中分解，这次你没有忘记"}
{"time": 1761046476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113951920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "沉浸在自己的情绪里，等到水温降下来才有所感，拍拍水面之后拍拍自己的脸颊，深吸一口气，虽然自己平庸，没有什么才能。但是...也没有必要妄自菲薄。总有自己能做的事情，从水里起身擦拭身体。盯着镜子面上的一层水汽，看着里面模糊的自己。"}
{"time": 1761046746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858494388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1113951920]头发沾了水颜色更深了。与之对应的是皮肤有些泛红。外面有些动静，好像是父亲回来了"}
{"time": 1761046882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138412344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这一头有些过分长的长发每次都感觉很难处理，擦干净身上的水，拿毛巾裹住头发，穿上准备换的衣服，推开浴室门。"}
{"time": 1761046906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352772845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我呢（）"}
