{"time": 1761071626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900780966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"除非?\"接过话，依然看着天空，\"留在这里也没什么意义吧...伊恩。\""}
{"time": 1761071690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568042102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也不是没有意义啦...能留在村子里，我挺开心的”"}
{"time": 1761071827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871456171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"到了这里很是沉默了一会，叹了一口气，\"不属于这里的人，最后一定会离开的。就当是为了我好吗？伊恩，跟肯特哥去前线吧。就当是为了我...\""}
{"time": 1761071873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787879786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "村子里的光源越来越少，因此天空的细节越发明显。在静滞的星河中，有几缕发丝般细微的白光划过"}
{"time": 1761071881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425486422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....不要”"}
{"time": 1761071901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54508306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我珍视的一切都在这里..我不想离开”"}
{"time": 1761072068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1040183941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "并没有怎么在意那些白光，\"...\""}
{"time": 1761072161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604057686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（今晚就发梦.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761072165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1207374566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...确实呢...也不能因为我，就让伊恩去前线那种危险的地方...\"手指拂过蓝色的发丝，自己的分量果然没有那么重，\"抱歉...\""}
{"time": 1761072197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1435521297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是怎么说得防线很远一样（）"}
{"time": 1761072200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744527509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...不想和舒茉分开...”"}
{"time": 1761072365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110832080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"......\"听见了，但是要假装没有听见，偏过脑袋看向另一侧，\"有点犯规...\"用只有自己能听见的声音小声嘟囔"}
{"time": 1761072440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285185295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=744527509]说完这句话之后感觉心跳加速，完全不敢去看舒茉了..."}
{"time": 1761072544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094227564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"什么...?伊恩刚刚说了什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1761072576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895247769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "没听见吗...有些低迷"}
{"time": 1761072617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252579930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“反正我不会走的..和舒茉在一起很开心..而且我也没有什么离开的理由”"}
{"time": 1761072743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674928410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你直接说你不喜欢他（）"}
{"time": 1761072776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425514517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我就说不想和朋友分开（）"}
{"time": 1761072804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1292334195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿起油灯吹灭，\"...\"借着夜色掩盖自己的脸红，今天的自己确实也需要静一静，\"休息了...\""}
{"time": 1761072824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123968942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有点困...\"语气故作疲态"}
{"time": 1761072869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "788071377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“晚安....”不过还不能离开，衣服还没缝好"}
{"time": 1761072908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669941469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不缝就不走了？）"}
{"time": 1761072955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702732679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1669941469]（感觉怪怪的）"}
{"time": 1761073046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1234160721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你就不能之后再来取（）"}
{"time": 1761073060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（也行吧）"}
{"time": 1761073073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "340661531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "躺椅倒也没有搬进屋的必要，提着熄掉的灯进屋，放下油灯逃也似地回了自己的房间关上门，背靠着门喘气，脸颊有些发烫"}
{"time": 1761073168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62382300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我教你，我现在给你发一个奈雅丽）"}
{"time": 1761073185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320939596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就会开始滑向稳定的三角形了）"}
{"time": 1761073189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417470826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己是被讨厌了吗...有些不太懂，等到回过神来，自己已经回到家门口了..至少，希望还可以做朋友"}
{"time": 1761073314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550418640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=62382300]（那很无敌了（）"}
{"time": 1761073400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608764671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1417470826]“家”里空无一人，除了蚊虫以外连蛇鼠也呆不住。这是没有温度的“居所”，只有黑暗与你有关。"}
{"time": 1761073454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102220437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "直到躺在床上，身体还是有些抑制不住发烫，捂着额头，完全睡不着，清醒..."}
{"time": 1761073483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358974562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "已经习惯了黑暗，但与以往不同，有一点点对明天的害怕，害怕舒茉彻底不理自己了..."}
{"time": 1761073499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422007736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=102220437]离你的生物钟还有些时间，你的门又轻轻响了响"}
{"time": 1761073576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34291513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从床上爬起来，轻轻拉开一点门缝"}
{"time": 1761073627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370831649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈...?\"自己的脸色恐怕还没完全恢复正常，侧着脸不让母亲完全看到"}
{"time": 1761073786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797051486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=34291513]舒蕾的手中拿着一个小盒子“嗯哼，今天早上答应了你，所以尽可能挑了挑……怎么了，还在想他？”"}
{"time": 1761073977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20629910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没...没...！\"被戳中心事，有些慌乱，\"妈妈怎么这么说...\"把门打开，低着脑袋，双手背在身后摇晃"}
{"time": 1761074141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681819996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1358974562]辗转反侧，睡不着...怎么办，怎么办，怎么办怎么办啊，明天跟舒茉道个歉吧，也许道个歉她就会原谅自己了，要不要买点什么...但是送礼物会不会让她觉得自己还喜欢她..好纠结"}
{"time": 1761074152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884534728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1358974562]黑夜寂静如常，偏偏只有夜晚的虫鸣鸟叫传不进来。不过这伸手不见五指的地方，你却偏偏看得清"}
{"time": 1761074221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589359633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "单调、无趣、没有格调的房间……到现在也没添上几件能称得上装饰的东西"}
{"time": 1761074323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125160710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(明明没说不喜欢吧)"}
{"time": 1761074325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424159678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=20629910]“呀，那就是说中了？”她把盒子塞到你怀里“我又不是木头……说起来也快到那种年纪了诶”"}
{"time": 1761074341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621478129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(为什么突然滑到这里了)"}
{"time": 1761074406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565384605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是上一秒男孩对女孩说了类似喜欢的话，然后下一秒女孩就走了（）"}
{"time": 1761074422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105966514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（真是不解风情）"}
{"time": 1761074490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1204411963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（胡思乱想也很正常吧，青春期小孩子）"}
{"time": 1761074492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776320806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1424159678]\"妈妈真是的...\"刚刚才退下去的红晕又升了起来，捧着盒子，\"我也不知道...舒茉希望他可以离开...他肯定不可能待在这么小的地方...\""}
{"time": 1761074565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861570291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "也许只是害羞了也有可能吧..其实舒茉也喜欢自己...伊恩你在想什么呢，怎么会有这种可能，但万一呢...左右脑不断互搏"}
{"time": 1761074643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867135058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=776320806]“嗯……嗯。”她点了点头“这点倒是不太像嘛，你和我。舒茉……虽然现在跟你说，你肯定听不进去，但……只想着别人是不行的哦？”"}
{"time": 1761074744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "213483773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...妈妈想说什么...?我哪有只想着他...\"脸色更红，\"啊...再说下去会睡不着的...\""}
{"time": 1761074843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471704831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我想说的已经说完了啊”她耸耸肩，把门关上“再说多了，一时半会你也听不进吧……嘛，反正早晚会明白的啦”"}
{"time": 1761074951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258191484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1861570291]不属于你的心脏空虚地跳动着，久了，总有些疲惫"}
{"time": 1761074953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448874606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好了好了...我要睡觉了。\"合上门，虽然这么说，完全睡不着....捡起地上随手乱扔的笔记本，走到桌边坐下，打开妈妈给的盒子"}
{"time": 1761074982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1397365159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好累...慢慢沉入了梦乡"}
{"time": 1761075169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1806790472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1448874606]盒子里是一对分开看并不对称的月光石耳环，看起来是用同一枚珠子切开，各自嵌在底座上。放在一起的时候才觉得圆融。此外还有一枚挂着银链的发卡，银链上夹着一些细小的青金石碎，末端则是另一枚月光石"}
{"time": 1761075338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681974015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"幸福的感觉涌上心头，\"真好...\"把盒子郑重地收纳在抽屉里，重新躺回床上，刚刚还在燥热的身体此刻倒是平静下来，试图让自己睡过去...\"明天要不要说...其实自己听见了...\"这么想着，总算睡了过去"}
{"time": 1761075351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228351027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1397365159]今晚的梦格外难熬……巨大的湖泊裹挟着你，仿佛你生来就在这片水中。湖水翻涌起来，倒更像是海……把你抛起又落下，却就是不肯松开你"}
{"time": 1761075482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269564671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好晕......"}
{"time": 1761075627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071147987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不知过了多久，水体突然平息……在把你举到最高点的后一刻。你从浪尖落下，不知为何，你觉得那种坠落感你不是第一次体验。"}
{"time": 1761075762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096090416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要抓住什么，挣扎着...不要.."}
