{"time": 1761106284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082889415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（都一样吧（）"}
{"time": 1761106382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875076009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(卧槽，我看到微信叫我下午汇报，但是突然想到今天下午有一节课，舒服了。)"}
{"time": 1761106388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570508445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(虽然这节课我一次没去过)"}
{"time": 1761106403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120627805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "仓库里外气温倒是没什么区别，但仓库再怎么不堪也起码能遮风。天空倒是格外澄澈，蓝盈盈的，没有几片云彩"}
{"time": 1761106438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592768449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后回去换一件衣服，再回河边把病号服洗一下...是不是该去找舒茉问清楚呢，万一她还没醒呢，万一..不敢继续想了，先专心洗衣服吧"}
{"time": 1761106542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040561520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=110001341]依旧是轻巧的敲门声，不过好像比平日晚了些"}
{"time": 1761106617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565383792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "睡得有些沉，敲门声响了一会才堪堪醒转，\"...妈?直接进来嘛...\""}
{"time": 1761106667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046261455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1592768449]你回去换衣服的时候，发现仓库门口站了个人——看起来衣冠楚楚，显然不是因为看上了你房间里的垃圾"}
{"time": 1761106708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1731297969", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“请问你找谁？”"}
{"time": 1761106728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388028614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“请问你有什么事吗？”有些疑惑"}
{"time": 1761106748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047680978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1565383792]“该起床咯，今天已经晚了些了……降温了，今天记得穿厚点喔”"}
{"time": 1761107033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022839153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=388028614]“伊恩，是吗？”*他转过头来，穿着服帖的正装，好像是村长身边见过的人“我是埃尔文防线的物资部副部长，雷明顿。听说你昨天遇袭了？”"}
{"time": 1761107056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292685805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃个饭）"}
{"time": 1761107061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323968497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔唔...知道了...\"打着长长的哈欠，感受到了被子外的温度，\"哇呜...有点冷。\"慢吞吞地从床上坐起来，用被子把自己裹紧，坐了一会之后才起身打开衣柜找衣服。\n翻出一套加绒的黑色裤装，上衣也相应地换成白色的棉衣，想了一会，给自己加上一条米色的披肩。"}
{"time": 1761107323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841341094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（显然是防线来做公关的）"}
{"time": 1761107519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869611785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(大做文章)"}
{"time": 1761107617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123007891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "洗漱完，穿戴整齐之后离开自己的房间，\"妈，今天早上吃什么?\"呼吸一下降了温的秋天的冷气，感觉头脑都清醒了不少。"}
{"time": 1761107627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245807845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=323968497]家里依旧是那副模样。尽管还没冷到那个地步，不过看起来壁炉刚被清理干净，随时能投入使用"}
{"time": 1761107631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607973867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1022839153][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “应该吧...我记得不是很清楚了”"}
{"time": 1761107654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028784591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（应该吗）"}
{"time": 1761107732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "109146144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过我确实受伤了，伤口看着是猫妖造成的”"}
{"time": 1761107861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904732523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2123007891]“刚烙了煎饼——”*她的声音从后院传来“在厨房，你自己拿一下——”"}
{"time": 1761108023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997813480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=109146144]“嗯，抱歉让你受惊了。有怪物越过防线是我们的失职。”他道歉，至少言辞听着相当诚恳“防线方正在排查漏洞，你还记得事发地点在哪里吗？”"}
{"time": 1761108049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145034108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能..大概是东边的林子吧”"}
{"time": 1761108060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253448402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "努力去回忆昨天的事情"}
{"time": 1761108074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725470954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（具体一点啊.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761108089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794586906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你只是不记得过程，又不是不记得在哪）"}
{"time": 1761108096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729903839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（oh）"}
{"time": 1761108096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845028719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1904732523]\"好嘞。\"高声答了一声，去厨房取出煎饼，倒两杯热水，惬意地叼着煎饼带着两杯水去后院看看妈妈在做什么。"}
{"time": 1761108105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933472865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“需要我带您过去吗”"}
{"time": 1761108549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858765839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1845028719]她坐在一把小凳子上，附近是那个烧炭用的小土坑，用开了两个孔的金属板盖着，灰烟从孔洞挤出，能想象到里头整齐地排着粗细均匀的木条。这些热量也没有浪费，板子上放了几颗没有剥掉叶衣的玉米，还把做腊味的架子拖了过来，上面挂了两块熏肉"}
{"time": 1761108665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620689808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=933472865]“我不善勘察”他从怀里拿出一张地图，看起来是简化过的版本，信息量不算大，没学过地理的人也能看懂，“如果你还记得的话，麻烦在这上面标注一下”"}
{"time": 1761108712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867698189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦好”在上面圈一下事发地点"}
{"time": 1761108895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157617460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把水杯递给妈妈，自己的杯子放在地上，站在一边开始吃早餐的煎饼，说话含混不清，\"好诶，有熏肉呲。\"蹲下身子，咀嚼咀嚼。"}
{"time": 1761109177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262087840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“感谢配合。”他点点头，但是没有立刻收起地图，而是在村里的某个地方圈了一处，“这里有一间空房子，单人间，原本是防线投资的公职人员中转处。不过现在有了新的。”他拿出一把钥匙“家具和配套设施还算齐全。我和村长讨论过了，他也觉得这是合适的处理”"}
{"time": 1761109279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162164399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的可以吗..”有些激动的接过钥匙“谢谢..”"}
{"time": 1761109308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121463583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "没想到还有这种意外之喜"}
{"time": 1761109393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "204887971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢大叔”"}
{"time": 1761109413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036317189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "深深的鞠一躬"}
{"time": 1761109469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72595794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=157617460]“嗯哼，感觉今年凉的早。现在太阳还大，正好能做这个”她一身烟灰，没有来摸你的脑袋“昨天那副首饰不打算试试看吗？”"}
{"time": 1761109664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126139854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1036317189]“没什么，这是我们应该做的。预祝乔迁。”他摇摇头"}
{"time": 1761109834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932034383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=72595794]\"舒茉想好好收藏啦...\"仔细想了一想，\"不过，妈妈要是想看的话，待会来帮我戴嘛。\"靠近她一些，拿自己的帕子给她擦掉身上的灰尘。"}
{"time": 1761109879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301784651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那再见了，大叔，祝你工作顺利”"}
{"time": 1761110143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715321648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=932034383]“呀，又不是拿来收藏的，连生日礼物都不算”*她笑笑“晚些时候吧，现在不方便”"}
{"time": 1761110192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347996457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1301784651]那他走了"}
{"time": 1761110263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551766992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过自己好像也没几件家当，把衣服给带上，然后去新家看看"}
{"time": 1761110313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937480227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1715321648]\"诶?但是看上去就很好看嘛。\"灰尘擦的差不多了，收起帕子，\"舒茉都不知道搭什么衣服好...\""}
{"time": 1761110450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731201364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=551766992]那是个独占了街道一侧的单间。地段并不优越，靠近商道而远离集市，但是坐北朝南，采光良好。光是有窗户就已经比仓库好的多了"}
{"time": 1761110600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465324150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1937480227]“是哦，说起来你今年又长高了点，快要跟我一样高了……怎么样，今天晚些去逛逛？”"}
{"time": 1761110611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666784849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，什么时候才会ttk）"}
{"time": 1761110784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683382294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1465324150]\"妈妈最好了。\"直接抱住妈妈的手臂，\"那我现在去准备一下。\"一路蹦蹦跳跳回自己的房间，打开抽屉拿出里面的饰品，对着镜子研究一下戴法"}
