{"time": 1761117740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107931487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“总之舒茉就是很漂亮啦，笑容像太阳一样有感染力，不小心就入迷了”抬起头，看着舒茉的眼睛，破罐子破摔的说到"}
{"time": 1761117770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046550077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以夸人好看为什么会小声.jpg）"}
