{"time": 1761117895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393889402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，不坦率。感觉分分钟被玩的团团转啊）"}
{"time": 1761117931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432847217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谢谢～\"被这么一夸心情当然会更好，不自觉勾起嘴角微微笑，伸手拂过耳朵，把发丝别到耳朵后，\"嗯...伊恩怎么突然找过来?\""}
{"time": 1761118039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016974736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"咳咳咳\"努力去保持冷静“有位大叔找上我，说自己是物资部的副部长，为了弥补我昨天被袭击，送了我一套房子”把钥匙拿出来给舒茉看看"}
{"time": 1761118118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709390183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当然也不是那么简单的原因）"}
{"time": 1761118174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506427412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...伊恩被前线的人看上了?\"虽然知道迟早有这么一天，不过没想到来得这么快，\"嗯...这是好事...\""}
{"time": 1761118368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "297040798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？居然是这样吗？我还以为只是单纯的补偿呢”"}
{"time": 1761118414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "237689053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...笨，你看他来找我了吗？\"伸出手点点对方的额头，\"要我帮你整理一下房子吗？\"语气很轻"}
{"time": 1761118517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418217625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好啊，那晚上我请舒茉吃饭吧”"}
{"time": 1761118634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163815012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"吃内脏?\"歪着脑袋，一脸坏笑"}
{"time": 1761118667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362689295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“额，舒茉想的的话，我也没有意见...”"}
{"time": 1761118886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571624540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦...\"看着他身上的衣着，\"今天都降温了...在这等一下我哦?\"\n说完小跑着回自己房间，翻出一条灰色的围巾，看着还在自己房间里的母亲开口，\"妈，我出趟门。\""}
{"time": 1761119396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "613496670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] ）"}
{"time": 1761120766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264804431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=A8456474D457B4CC2E842B5E6E107D24.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR8hTfd0jEbKSYN2dBrcBf4vndhwRjKXiD_Ciink4yNrreQAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhCkKAyiHCOQ648tmOuKI2JSegILN4IBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAESMLsf9HQm0vbQRKsya0dat55ltmMJbUp2vE39xVHV5Sq3u2ssPLlHK3BltSdRhjvimA,file_size=12106]"}
