{"time": 1761122028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094540177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好困）"}
{"time": 1761122036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588747235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是睡着了）"}
{"time": 1761122045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601885065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是你不是一觉睡到了12点）"}
{"time": 1761122131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767758603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没有午觉是这样滴)"}
{"time": 1761122136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770050401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我上课上的也很困)"}
{"time": 1761122152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924305150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1094540177]（醒了继续（））[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1761122228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712702876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=571624540]“出门……这次去哪？”她握着自己的手，不可避免地有些担心"}
{"time": 1761122430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "270357867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就在村子里啦，伊恩说他搬了新家，我去帮他收拾收拾。\"双手握住她的手传递自己的温度，\"妈妈别担心嘛，舒茉不会出事的。\""}
{"time": 1761122627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958459718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（迷糊了哎）"}
{"time": 1761122644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571474068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（洗把脸）"}
{"time": 1761122662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533728089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=3CD68A2F9D6A43CC44356C9C2A92586F.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQLttqOV33Ju-tw3tHR55ynudusTBiOyQYg_wooxPvklLW3kAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ3yu-c9rFzBwauZpeIf1Lt3oCQiKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMK-GSQLkfFojjymhKca6y3HxWWZ_UYGYQC2Vf0tcISGnDY2Ad9qdrKAsw19swX0bEQ,file_size=107662]"}
{"time": 1761122670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52458840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(清醒了吗)"}
{"time": 1761122879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175147223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=270357867]“喔，好吧好吧。用不用帮忙？”她眨眨眼"}
{"time": 1761122995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336847283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1175147223]\"诶...\"虽然妈妈帮忙的话会很快，但是...\"不...不用了吧...\"说完有些脸红，不敢看母亲"}
{"time": 1761123299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589969421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎呀，真是……”她似乎还想说什么，不过还是咽回去了“算了，去吧”"}
{"time": 1761123509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026063359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"先转过身，然后拍拍自己的脸，回到门口换好鞋子，\"伊恩?妈妈同意了，你带路哦?\"把灰色的围巾递给他，\"要不要我帮你围上?嗯...以前是我在用，所以可能有点小...\""}
{"time": 1761123564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172694985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以吗，那拜托你了，舒茉帮我围上吧，谢谢”"}
{"time": 1761123687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690245195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "双手拿着围巾绕到伊恩的脖子后面，思考了一下简单围了两圈，把其中一端从围巾之间的缝隙中插了进去，\"真是的，降温了要注意好保暖啊。\""}
{"time": 1761123834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133024752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我以后会注意的”感觉今天真美好啊“那我们走吧，舒茉跟紧我，或者...”朝她伸出手，眼睛看向其他地方，有些害羞，不太敢看向舒茉"}
{"time": 1761123995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "501158187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦呀～\"绕到他视线上，嘴角一直没有放下来过，\"伊恩想找我要什么东西吗？\"语气揶揄"}
{"time": 1761124122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249329003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没...没什么，我们走吧”也许可能太快了，还是慢慢来吧"}
{"time": 1761124254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373186071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "笑嘻嘻地牵起他的手，\"这样?\""}
{"time": 1761124339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505869576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....嗯”有些突然，甚至有点没有反应过来，整个人完全怔住了"}
{"time": 1761124362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595606572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..我们...走吧”"}
{"time": 1761124506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073851111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"以前又不是没牵过手，怎么现在反而还不习惯了？\"点着脑袋，拉着他走"}
{"time": 1761124607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529554304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是吗...可能因为那时候..还小吧”感觉说话都不像以前那么顺了“也许..多习惯..习惯就好了”"}
{"time": 1761124826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034663535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还小?诶——\"拖长音，\"有什么区别吗？\"心情很好，走起来很轻快"}
{"time": 1761124962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524320727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，考验期）"}
{"time": 1761125052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063710353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "以你家为参照物的话，伊恩的新家在距离上倒是和仓库差不多"}
{"time": 1761125058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890781204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也许大概可能...没有吧”开心的一起走着"}
{"time": 1761125270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989942054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我发现了）"}
{"time": 1761125285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074551529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你发现什么了）"}
{"time": 1761125341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807878059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=890781204]\"真的吗？那为什么，看上去这么不自然?\"一个词一个词地开口，\"要是有心事，要跟我讲哦?\"摇摇手"}
{"time": 1761125392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538570373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有啦，没有啦，我没有心事”急忙否定"}
{"time": 1761125418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877531360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "仿佛在掩藏什么一样"}
{"time": 1761125537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416938045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们有一搭没一搭地聊着，走得磨磨蹭蹭。直到……你们的视线在彼此以外的余光瞥见了一个老熟人。是金发的肯特，说得上有些闪亮。发现的时候再松手已经晚了"}
{"time": 1761125557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534075799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就不松"}
{"time": 1761125684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494105201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"其实有些想松开，甩了甩，最后放弃了，\"啊...\"低下脑袋"}
{"time": 1761125774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664121139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“肯特哥，你好啊”跟他打个招呼"}
{"time": 1761125977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "843703308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，早上好”他挑了挑眉，你注意到他胸前多了枚小徽章“你们……是我想的那样？”"}
{"time": 1761126165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75661474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "光速后悔，不知道该怎么解释“呃，在回忆童年吧....”"}
{"time": 1761126335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779535095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些接不上话，轻咳了两声，\"肯特哥怎么在这里?\"生硬地转移话题，\"这几天就过去了吗?\""}
{"time": 1761126557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628484303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“面试过了，今天回来收拾些东西。昨天只有人去了嘛”他看起来有些揶揄“总感觉昨天见你们还没这么……光明正大”"}
{"time": 1761126882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490855870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"这怎么回答，脑袋偏向一侧，等伊恩自己接去吧"}
{"time": 1761126911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1178418233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈哈...今天天气不错啊”"}
{"time": 1761126926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429807335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1761126939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965375422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“开个玩笑....”"}
{"time": 1761127326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943537008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打算把自己置身事外，看着街角日常的风景。"}
{"time": 1761127332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1040401797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说完了？）"}
{"time": 1761127346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52909228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们关系一直都挺好的...”"}
{"time": 1761127578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244293938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也不是说你们以前关系不好”他琢磨着说法“但是不是一个好法……算了，我纠结这个干什么”"}
{"time": 1761127627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "758952594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不说这个了，我听说昨天村里有人被猫妖袭击了？”"}
{"time": 1761127897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655550537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"终于换了话题，\"我们还真的很了解这个。\""}
{"time": 1761127954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358477266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“被袭击的正好是我们两....”"}
{"time": 1761128198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318599236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔……没什么大碍吧？”他严肃了一点，上下仔细打量了一番“虽然不是什么厉害的东西，但是……喔，差点忘了伊恩会魔法了”"}
{"time": 1761128376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116411788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢肯特哥关心了，我已经去找神官姐姐和医生姐姐治疗过了，现在感觉就像没事一样”"}
{"time": 1761128413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179634600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"对。\"点点头，开口\"当时那只猫妖被伊恩用一个很大的冰球击退了哦?\"停了一下，\"肯特哥有没有办法把伊恩带到前线去?\""}
{"time": 1761128482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058329271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？怎么又说这个啊,我还没成年呢”"}
{"time": 1761128563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582544474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"无视他的话，\"毕竟前线的副官都来找上伊恩了，我觉得也是时间问题吧？肯特哥怎么看?\""}
{"time": 1761128708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590669884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“前线不是什么难去的地方啊，跟着商队的马车走，捎一阵子就行……副官来过了？哦，你说的是那种‘去前线’？”他理解过来“我没那种权利的，不过昨天出事之后，确实工作量大了起来，能感觉到气氛有些紧张”"}
{"time": 1761128815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870911771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“以后再说吧...”"}
{"time": 1761129040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736140242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还没想好呢....”"}
{"time": 1761129056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400107702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...我本来想...\"听见伊恩的话倒也没继续说下去，\"肯特哥拜拜。\"挥手作别，继续往前走，\"嗯...\"一边走一边沉吟"}
{"time": 1761129082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466762459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“再见，肯特哥”"}
{"time": 1761129179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282605918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，拜拜。如果只是想去看看的话，明天倒是有一班车”他说完就往自己家走去"}
{"time": 1761129224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476867700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"要不我们明天去看看?\"沉吟了一会才开口"}
{"time": 1761129348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643293396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉也去吗...会不会有点危险”"}
{"time": 1761129387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480609092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那你一个人去?\""}
{"time": 1761129401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754958674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要...”"}
{"time": 1761129439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827390078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，既然舒茉一直说这件事，那一起去吧..”"}
{"time": 1761129544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086171024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就是不知道妈妈会不会同意啦。\"呢喃，\"算了。\"语气重新活跃起来，\"快点啦，跑起来，迫不及待想看看伊恩的新家呢。\""}
{"time": 1761129672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068100293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(吃个饭)"}
{"time": 1761129797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109859691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如何评价）"}
{"time": 1761129804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955022578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（小龙女的学校有个教学楼）"}
{"time": 1761129808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519578197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（叫翔宇楼）"}
{"time": 1761129831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961767527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1761129849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271272591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看看谁捐的楼)"}
{"time": 1761130838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683878310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我捐的）"}
{"time": 1761130872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972260943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2086171024][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “嗯...”拉着舒茉的手，小步快跑起来，回家"}
{"time": 1761131015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136763864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看上去不错诶...虽然伊恩可以...\"停住，没继续说，\"里面现在怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1761131016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173002557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们回到了那个窗明几亮的屋子，其实灰尘不算多"}
{"time": 1761131147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712860188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉蛮不错的，哪怕不是和仓库比，也挺好的”"}
{"time": 1761131154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338663288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拿出钥匙打开房门"}
{"time": 1761131309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749357037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟在身后进去，\"嗯...很新诶。\"琢磨一下怎么打扫，\"先洒点水吧。\""}
{"time": 1761131350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925143623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，都听你的...理论上，这房子舒茉也应该有所有权吧...毕竟我们两个都被袭击了”"}
{"time": 1761131364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039732321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哪来的理论）"}
{"time": 1761131397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2042561101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我?\"指着自己，\"我肯定...没有了。真是的，突然说出这种不得了的话。\"背过身，找一找室内的笤帚"}
{"time": 1761131618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333618234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看伊恩有没有带过来（）"}
{"time": 1761131630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220122449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那我带过来了吧"}
{"time": 1761131671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832067569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "屋子里自然没有生活用品，家具倒是比仓库里的好些，起码床是如此，虽然没有床垫，但是结实且防虫，有股淡淡的松香"}
{"time": 1761131744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837629764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，仔细想想，能说出那种话就像我是女主人一样。\"用一种调笑的语气开口，\"好了，去买你要用的生活物品吧，床垫啦...灯具啦...还有被单被芯这些呢\""}
{"time": 1761131824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55879654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以那么觉得”非常小的声音，然后正常音量“仓库那边有一部分啦，搬过来就好”"}
{"time": 1761131878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343516323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "浴室里留了两个盆和两个桶，此外虽然没有厨房，但是客厅和卧室都有连着烟囱的壁炉"}
{"time": 1761132016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888886062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还得准备一点木柴呢？\"自顾自说到，\"毕竟有壁炉可不能不用。\""}
{"time": 1761132067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343099386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=55879654]（为什么不索性在心里说，是因为想被听见吗）"}
{"time": 1761132068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84005520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事的时候也可以用壁炉烤点东西。\"看见他还停在原地，\"好啦好啦，快点去搬啦，这里我来打扫就行。\""}
{"time": 1761132076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588547941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我听见了吗)"}
{"time": 1761132109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906810420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得没吧）"}
{"time": 1761132129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796238005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1343099386]（你管我（bushi）"}
{"time": 1761132156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519582071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那拜托舒茉了”"}
{"time": 1761132170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433319916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回仓库去搬东西吧"}
{"time": 1761132311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422578063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "洒点水在地上，先处理家具上的灰尘"}
{"time": 1761132397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896761135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎闷骚）"}
{"time": 1761132476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876362557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=433319916]你回到那个你住了七八年的仓库，里面和你离开时没什么区别"}
{"time": 1761132581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868266617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把自己留在这里的生活用品整理一下，然后分批开始慢慢搬"}
{"time": 1761132644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932976496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "擦完家具上的灰尘，再开始拖已经洒了水的地板。"}
{"time": 1761132662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523437011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1422578063]上次清扫大概也就是半个月内的事。期间关门关窗，也没人住，灰尘不多。也没有需要浣洗的坐垫之类"}
{"time": 1761132706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138990353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉心情格外的好，嘴角一直上扬，压都压不住"}
{"time": 1761132869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50229176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着房子越来越有活力，满意地点点头，清扫完之后抱一捆木柴进屋，在壁炉里点起来，“呼...”"}
{"time": 1761133168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867383246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2138990353]你搬了两批，基本就没了。无非两套床具，冬夏各两三套衣服。摆件很少，用品也不多"}
