{"time": 1761133414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888585636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒茉坐在客厅的两张椅子之一上，靠在点着的壁炉旁边"}
{"time": 1761133492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749590683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“睡着了？”想到舒茉这么累还为自己打扫房间有些感动，去把床铺一下，然后动作轻轻的把舒茉抱到床上"}
{"time": 1761133539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292720892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"本来想说点什么欢迎回来的话，但是...这样也挺好，索性装作睡着了"}
{"time": 1761133612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990699453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么不是搬个椅子到旁边一起睡（））"}
