{"time": 1761135503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "89106089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...伊恩动作太大了....\"揉着眼睛，装作刚醒来，\"唔...\""}
