{"time": 1761135705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575038795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉很喜欢吃昨天林子的水果吧，我给你摘一点带回来”"}
{"time": 1761135766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936386580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不用专门去的...那边又不安全...\""}
{"time": 1761135814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803417489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，那里刚出过事，这几天肯定会反复检查，不如说反而是最安全的时候，舒茉不用担心啦，你好好休息就好”"}
{"time": 1761136045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "638152015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...那我也去，我没那么累啦，不跟着一起的话...也没有事做。\""}
