{"time": 1761149438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145253530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（抢鞋？）"}
{"time": 1761149462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783387724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(应该是吧)"}
{"time": 1761149553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656971694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（随意）"}
{"time": 1761149568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1257713250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd"}
{"time": 1761149568, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1257713250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[莉维娅]演奏出: 1D20=14"}
{"time": 1761149598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2009978695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在想)"}
{"time": 1761149750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600621024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然自己的动作理应更快，但最后还是迟疑了一下，自己真的要...摇摇头思索的功夫，已经慢了一步"}
{"time": 1761149769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802162202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在干嘛）"}
{"time": 1761149778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "603351354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1761150064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814602925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到舒茉的话刚刚怔了一下，本以为来不及的，但还是赶上了，帮舒茉穿鞋“我是自愿留下来的,没有什么被困在这的说法...”"}
{"time": 1761150199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039540996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这叫不上进啦...\"无奈地看着他，\"鞋你也穿了，还杵在这干嘛，走啦，去林子看看。\""}
{"time": 1761150276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703157777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，那我们走吧”再次朝舒茉伸出手，但这次眼睛就看着舒茉，不在像之前一样逃避"}
{"time": 1761150432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267423441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（被人偷窥就知错了）"}
{"time": 1761150460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "529643730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1596698886]（素材复用）"}
{"time": 1761150504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315503823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "避开视线，脸上的红晕怎么都盖不住，\"真是的...今天怎么这么得寸进尺...\"双手绞在胸前"}
{"time": 1761150833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070727977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我只是想...表明我的心意...我想留下来陪着..舒茉”"}
{"time": 1761150958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10708415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然说话仍然断断续续的..但这次努力的完全说了出来"}
{"time": 1761151060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907532970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...啊啊...就算最后会籍籍无名?一辈子在这种小村子里?\"有些烦地抓了抓垂下来的头发"}
{"time": 1761151288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362111708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不在乎那些....”"}
{"time": 1761151394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429310920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且未来还很遥远，说不定舒茉也会成为很厉害的人”"}
{"time": 1761151493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792117513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1362111708]\"...舒茉很在乎...伊恩也看出来了吧...\"下定决心，抬起头看着他，脸颊依然挂着褪不掉的红晕，\"我太平凡了，如果因为我...让伊恩不能去更广阔的地方...舒茉...会内疚到睡不着...\""}
{"time": 1761151586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834943336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是，我从来没有想过去更远的地方...假如舒茉很厉害的话，我让舒茉离开，舒茉会走吗...”"}
{"time": 1761151750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565953654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1834943336]\"...太...太狡猾了...\"咬着嘴唇，\"明明不是一样的事情...在说的...明明是现在的事吧...\""}
{"time": 1761151843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300788359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了...先不聊这些了，在晚点的会，都要天黑了，就去不了林子了，走吧走吧”"}
{"time": 1761151865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753782186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不都到了）"}
{"time": 1761151899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387304535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（虽然你已经发了景物描写，但我们还没出发）"}
{"time": 1761152080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465530238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"不知道该怎么说，大脑也有些卡壳，\"...你走在前面。\""}
{"time": 1761152106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680172550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧..”"}
{"time": 1761152251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1240799338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "带个袋子，往树林走去"}
{"time": 1761152293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638468417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "今天的景色明明很好，但没什么想欣赏的兴致，跟在后面有一步没一步地走着，一路都在卷自己的头发"}
{"time": 1761152487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465956119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要说些什么，偶尔回头看向舒茉，但感觉她没什么兴致"}
{"time": 1761152606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777920270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "到了昨天遇袭的地方，咽了口唾沫，\"...就是这里。\""}
{"time": 1761152925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045224468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，今天应该不会有什么事了”"}
{"time": 1761152943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1491070347", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们快点多摘些水果就离开吧”"}
{"time": 1761152970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767573495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过我们还是多摘些水果就快快离开吧...”"}
{"time": 1761153003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620460430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"虽然他这么说，但是总有些心不在焉，如果真的被袭击，自己难道...又要看着吗？\"摘...摘一些吧....\""}
{"time": 1761153089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294869785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "挑一些又大颜色又好的摘"}
{"time": 1761153365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572051787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "这里昼夜温差大，浆果尤其甜，野生病虫害也少"}
{"time": 1761153434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599972474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "心不在焉地跟着一起摘浆果，留意着周围的情况"}
{"time": 1761153533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2038182544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "安静的恰到好处，并不至于寂静。虫鸟和谐地鸣叫着，无事发生"}
{"time": 1761153693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817690369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们快点走吧...伊恩...\"心里隐隐约约还是有些不安，开口"}
{"time": 1761153727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185363624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉采的差不多了“好啊，一起回去吧，我请你吃晚饭”"}
{"time": 1761153779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761886741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"明明才中午饭吧，伊恩真是的...\""}
{"time": 1761153851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1204913430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉时间过了好久了，不过都一样啦，那就请舒茉吃两顿饭，走吧走吧”"}
{"time": 1761153878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696865020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（上次说有多少钱来着）"}
{"time": 1761153998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1894085870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1881302272]（）"}
{"time": 1761154007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072074278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(那我是有200银币)"}
{"time": 1761154067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522684868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我600)"}
{"time": 1761154104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720215124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "如果把刚刚发生的事情当做不存在，自己倒是可以心安理得，可是...迟疑着，迟迟没开口"}
{"time": 1761154145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041151167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了，舒茉是不开心吗...”"}
{"time": 1761154256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337209586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "框已半满，也许去集市也能卖个十几银币"}
{"time": 1761154331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351792050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没什么啦...\"挤出笑容，\"走吧，伊恩，今天说不定我会点很多东西，你可以吗？\""}
{"time": 1761154373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1279040740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“无所谓啦，都说我要请你了”"}
{"time": 1761154497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875727137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...走吧。\"安静地跟在他身后"}
{"time": 1761154522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "722613502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "稍微走慢点和她并排"}
{"time": 1761154604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357201666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "回程的路依然宁静，好似昨天发生的都是一场梦。无人打扰"}
{"time": 1761154701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247278467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"虽然没有在胡思乱想，但刚刚说的话一直盘旋在自己的脑海里，\"太没注意自己...妈妈...\"虽然只是想想，但好像下意识地呢喃出来了"}
{"time": 1761154764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254313626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”不太懂舒茉在说什么，但她好像在思考，就不打扰她了"}
{"time": 1761154855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721458236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该问的不问（）"}
{"time": 1761154901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137776052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1247278467]没人回应你的自言自语，回过神来，已经在村口了"}
{"time": 1761154906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683612268", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过还是有点好奇，这一路上也安静了太久了，想和舒茉多聊聊"}
{"time": 1761154943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092966702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉想吃什么”"}
{"time": 1761154974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593535054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "呼出一口气，\"中午倒是没什么胃口呢...黄油面包?嗯...可以的话希望有蓝莓果酱。\""}
{"time": 1761155128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "746237900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以啊，那走吧，不过先去把东西放一下吧”"}
{"time": 1761155269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063007969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没有提出反对意见，顺从地跟着走"}
{"time": 1761155296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179619820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就去舒茉家"}
{"time": 1761155485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366256856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，回来了”舒蕾在沙发上坐着，用小说打发着时间，两人份还冒着热气的午饭摆在桌上“怎么去了这么久？”"}
{"time": 1761155515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819887837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“去摘了一些水果，阿姨尝尝，很甜的”"}
{"time": 1761155521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167124757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈...\"声音有些怯怯的，看一眼午餐是什么"}
{"time": 1761155543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644515820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你平时吃什么就是什么（）"}
{"time": 1761155721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383483863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "芦笋，南瓜汤，撒了点白糖的面包。相当简单"}
{"time": 1761155760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400972389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯..妈妈吃过了?\"手指不停地卷着发丝"}
{"time": 1761155834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682030369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没啊……啊”她才看见伊恩“伊恩也要来吗？”"}
{"time": 1761155912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153307247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我倒不是很饿啦，不用管我啦，刚刚摘水果的时候吃了不少，阿姨要尝尝吗，很甜的”"}
{"time": 1761156019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375305749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只吃水果也不顶饿啊，菜倒是还有剩……面包只烤了这两份”"}
{"time": 1761156076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1068808631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系啦...谢谢阿姨”"}
{"time": 1761156117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282139719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"思索，\"我吃的比较少，伊恩吃我的一份就好了...算是...，谢礼。\""}
{"time": 1761156168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450600179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？早上明明是舒茉帮了我，怎要感谢也是我感谢啦”"}
{"time": 1761156231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235251687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎，又开始了”*她坐回沙发上，等你们商量出个结果"}
{"time": 1761156442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375108954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（每次到这种环节就会变成弗雷尔卓德童话）"}
{"time": 1761156456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130075699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呵呵）"}
{"time": 1761156558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710325793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总之先把水果放在茶几上了"}
{"time": 1761156681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487315246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（伊神呢）"}
{"time": 1761156810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932199067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么看起来像睡着了）"}
{"time": 1761156824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004786190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（脑袋一歪了已经）"}
{"time": 1761156826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495020093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没绷住）"}
{"time": 1761157308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742034148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃\""}
{"time": 1761157318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916116218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（呃？）"}
{"time": 1761157354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793338123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈这么说的话...那舒茉我就不客气了...\""}
{"time": 1761157368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492516210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1761157833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582629607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来假寐的是我)"}
{"time": 1761179188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260484330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] [CQ:at,qq=825734198] 有没有说法）"}
{"time": 1761180636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552096096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不知道龙神醒没醒)"}
{"time": 1761180729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1543768194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥早上不上班吗）"}
{"time": 1761181304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814369580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么九点了）"}
{"time": 1761181314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1447591968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你醒了，我刚准备喊你)"}
{"time": 1761181476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979773514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（让我们重新开始战斗吧）"}
{"time": 1761181902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1054490465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，睡眠时间差合）"}
{"time": 1761182076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95698949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之，也不是我动）"}
{"time": 1761182088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338311086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（看起来伊暂时好像也，有点忙吗？）"}
{"time": 1761182145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65997302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我喝点汤就可以了，谢谢阿姨”"}
{"time": 1761182453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179249623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她点点头，起身去厨房又盛了一碗冒着热气的南瓜汤……虽然浓稠到可以称为粥了"}
{"time": 1761182583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177831678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坐在餐桌上，慢慢的品尝午饭"}
{"time": 1761182657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072220904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看向舒茉，小声对她说“那个前线的事给阿姨说一下吧”"}
{"time": 1761183008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081964631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"双手合十，暂时没有动刀叉，\"妈...我明天想跟着车去一趟前线那边。\""}
{"time": 1761183165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628992502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她愣了一下“前线？怎么突然想去那里？不，倒不是说不行……跟着车应该也不会有什么危险吧”"}
{"time": 1761183218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406394349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会和舒茉一起去的..”补充道"}
{"time": 1761183313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696090208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"肯特哥哥给我的建议啦...他觉得我们过去一趟，应该不坏...\"心里对肯特哥说一句抱歉"}
{"time": 1761183504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149864984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“长长见识倒是不错啦……不过来往的车也不是每天都有”她想了想“要去的话，记得带点钱备着”"}
{"time": 1761183688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466758922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我身上有一些银币，去一两天应该够了。\"听完妈妈的话，开始动手吃午餐"}
{"time": 1761183784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483551489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了阿姨，晚上我要和舒茉去外面吃...阿姨不用做她的饭了，我请客....”"}
{"time": 1761184014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507914764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，知道了”她点点头“不过真少见呐”"}
{"time": 1761184178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371430703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（谁罕见.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761184264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825073827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"什么...\"心里慢了一拍，\"妈妈为什么这么说...\""}
{"time": 1761184554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968075942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“少见就是少见嘛？你也不是不知道伊恩什么条件。”她清清嗓子“不过有人搬新家了，倒也能理解”"}
{"time": 1761184752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512190275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“偶尔一顿其实还好啦...”"}
{"time": 1761184858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187676677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这一顿反正舒茉不会放掉的。\"咽下面包，\"我今天可是忙了一上午。\""}
{"time": 1761185094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604084660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“知道知道，又不拦你”她随手拿起一颗野莓放进嘴里“嗯，味道不错”"}
{"time": 1761185323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691964129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不过下午做什么？嗯...”想了想，“去镇上的图书室看看吗？或者...”抱着妈妈的腰贴贴，“妈妈有什么要我帮忙？明天就去前线的话...要好几天见不到妈妈了。”"}
{"time": 1761185585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443070021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“下午……机会难得，我教你熬果酱吧？”她笑着摸摸你的脑袋“密封得好的话能放很久的”"}
{"time": 1761185889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687668342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好诶，舒茉要好好学一学做饭。\"抱着她用脑袋蹭着她的手心，\"妈妈要多教我一些啦。\""}
{"time": 1761185928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541491485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我可以跟着一起学吗”"}
{"time": 1761186103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117449514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行啊，你们一起上我就只用动嘴皮子了，应该？”她伸个懒腰"}
{"time": 1761186205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554775893", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "吐吐舌头，\"那...先午休一下?\"抱着妈妈不松手，\"中午我还和妈妈一起睡啦。\""}
{"time": 1761186274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432248555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（hyw）"}
{"time": 1761186301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840814862", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我先回去了...下午我再过来吧”"}
{"time": 1761186354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312321842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(呃，为什么没有再编辑)"}
{"time": 1761186369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793426321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（太久了）"}
{"time": 1761186372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023945773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（太久了）"}
{"time": 1761186395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899227183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那...先午休一下吧？\"打个哈欠，\"中午想和妈妈一起睡。\""}
{"time": 1761186416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174334806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我先回去了...下午我再过来吧”"}
{"time": 1761186482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418873100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"来回跑不麻烦吗？\"吐吐舌头，\"伊恩中午可以去院子里的躺椅上睡一会的。\""}
{"time": 1761186584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668390191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1899227183]“你这丫头……”她像是洞穿你心思般看了看你，不过没有点破“行啊，不过先去洗脸啦，回来都没洗漱就先吃上了”"}
{"time": 1761186767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376663295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也可以吧”能早点再见到舒茉挺好的"}
{"time": 1761186841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761177744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"起身乖乖去洗漱，对着镜子摘掉耳坠，摸索着摘掉发夹，\"呼...\"紧接着整理自己的长发，找两根皮筋扎成两束。"}
{"time": 1761186889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651181878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（伊恩的收入来源和工作到底是什么（）"}
{"time": 1761186991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1971512398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（临时工？）"}
{"time": 1761187039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868745266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也许是)"}
{"time": 1761187159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869334091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（大概吧）"}
{"time": 1761187165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408497360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从洗手间出来，感觉人都精神了不少，\"伊恩记得拿一条毯子盖上哦?我就先进屋了。\"犹豫一下进妈妈的房间还是自己的，想了想最后还是进了自己的房间，换上家居服，坐到床上。"}
{"time": 1761187205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045555203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毯子去哪里拿...”"}
{"time": 1761187210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036430745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（vvan同款蓝色睡裙？）"}
{"time": 1761187409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "918101902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我没意见)"}
{"time": 1761187431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785101112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾帮你拿了一条棕色的毛毯，随后一如往常收拾着桌面"}
{"time": 1761187453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560850064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢阿姨”"}
{"time": 1761187576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255586354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "碗上没什么油，清洗没花多少时间。等她敲开舒茉的门，差不多刚到正午"}
{"time": 1761187614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564338293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "搬着躺椅去院子了"}
{"time": 1761187653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770569225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈...\"坐在床上，正没事做玩着自己的头发"}
{"time": 1761187823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395705614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后盖着毯子沐浴在阳光下午睡了"}
{"time": 1761187880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634513730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她关上门，坐到你旁边“这个也有一阵子没有了……嘛，被惦记的感觉也挺不错的？”"}
{"time": 1761187921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693560551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=395705614]尽管盖着毛毯，但起风的时候也多少有一点冷到让人缩脖子"}
{"time": 1761188007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1364753106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=634513730]\"明天就要出远门...走之前想多陪陪妈妈嘛。\"侧身倒在她怀里，闻到她身上的味道很是安心。"}
{"time": 1761188048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136276926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=693560551][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 蜷缩一下，然后凑合睡吧"}
{"time": 1761188532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460275207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1364753106]“哼哼，我就知道……”她捏捏你的耳朵“不过就算是有事献殷勤我也很开心”"}
{"time": 1761189024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166641587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶...舒茉绝对是发自真心啦，毕竟，去一趟不知道要什么时候才能回来。妈妈会不会想我？”咬咬自己的手指。"}
{"time": 1761189381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290301052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1136276926]你依旧睡得不太踏实，或许是因为躺椅会摇晃……你总觉得自己又在漂浮。梦到深处，你似乎闻到些许血腥味"}
{"time": 1761189571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1127131432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1166641587]“虽然你没出过这么久的门……不过只是防线而已，有多远啦，就算你跑到赫顿玛尔去我也能找得到你。只是……舒茉能再学会一点怎么好好照顾自己，我就安心啦”"}
{"time": 1761189598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567680456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1290301052][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 感受一些血腥味的来源"}
{"time": 1761189628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765072424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这怎么感受得到）"}
{"time": 1761189641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624579863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不是做梦吗）"}
{"time": 1761189647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513243233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以呢）"}
{"time": 1761189652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743557143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "通过嗅觉去寻找么"}
{"time": 1761189680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955254905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "梦里没有方向感，血腥气也不会变浓或变淡"}
{"time": 1761189821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910033121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又不是从哪传来的）"}
{"time": 1761189911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064418266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1127131432]\"嗯...\"闭上眼睛，\"我会好好学会照顾好自己...再过两年舒茉都成年了，可不能拿自己再当小孩呢。\"语气笃定。"}
{"time": 1761190035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341679876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好难受，讨厌血腥气...想要离开"}
{"time": 1761190036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533676197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我已经找好翔哥的职业了）"}
{"time": 1761190039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811950994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=2C4F7C4C720CA13D177A4AAF4572C849.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhS0X_Q-aKoGgx1XwkrCHHFEs1pbXRjs3wYg_wooh6qSlbC5kAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQIzgNiD_n0NMUcxee2Pf-c3oCaT6CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMA9zmsrjuou1ERnqcyDfd6WzR69gv2btW4FYuQNuIAbM68l9iy-8jbW8tx677Z3q2A,file_size=110572]"}
{"time": 1761190062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552605468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不想玩血魔法师（）"}
{"time": 1761190082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914224245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我一看，特殊心脏）"}
{"time": 1761190111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581895993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（男魔的特殊心脏不是底层逻辑么）"}
{"time": 1761190147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301280122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1064418266]“是嘛”她点点你的额头“我看不是会不会，是想不想嘛”"}
{"time": 1761190192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755052632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来是弗拉基"}
