{"time": 1761190341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214982546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=301280122]“诶，怎么这么说...”有点窘迫，还好自己闭着眼，转个身子把脸埋进母亲的怀里，“没有啦...”"}
