{"time": 1761208451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515571018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就像没人给菠萝注射酱油）"}
{"time": 1761208477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235770269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（开个玩笑（）"}
{"time": 1761208582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "802172994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过不加也行，现在买也来不及了”她把火架上"}
{"time": 1761208710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233862003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉...\"有些遗憾地叹气"}
{"time": 1761208850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701629886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "幸福的不规则黄色晶体分解消融，锅中的混合液体逐渐变得粘稠而深邃，咕嘟咕嘟地冒着小颗气泡"}
{"time": 1761208869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598378144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“反正林子里果子还有很多，过几天回来了再做一次就好了，下次把舒茉想要的东西都加进去”"}
{"time": 1761209024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180734272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...闻上去好香。\"扇动空气闻闻味道，\"果子原来能熬成这种东西...\""}
{"time": 1761209506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594709017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"去从柜子里翻出空的玻璃瓶。"}
{"time": 1761209519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360543455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“确实，直接就可以吃了吗？”"}
{"time": 1761209684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334078452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“放凉就好咯，自己参与的吃起来会不一样吧”她把火熄了，搅动粘稠的液体“去切点面包吧”"}
{"time": 1761209776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442871378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“少吃一点”小声对舒茉说"}
{"time": 1761210044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "797221565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"把瓶子放在桌台，去旁边的柜子拿干面包"}
{"time": 1761210142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087511146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（听起来是成长厨艺的时候）"}
{"time": 1761210163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929215163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（0怎么成长都成长了（））"}
{"time": 1761210170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310174871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想了想拿了三四片切成面包条放在碗里。"}
{"time": 1761210256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1311632416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想是成长还是算进人物升级里（））"}
{"time": 1761210365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704610668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯，伊恩要多吃一点。”摆好餐盘，“毕竟你中午没怎么吃。”"}
{"time": 1761210419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776533306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也不是很饿啦..而且不是已经快到晚饭时间了么”"}
{"time": 1761210482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1222129208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾把果酱大部分都舀进玻璃罐里，差不多刚好装满。留下锅底上的一层，正好适合用面包清扫"}
{"time": 1761210510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277448508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那你正好多吃一点，这不是好事吗？”率先拿起一块沾一点果酱尝尝味"}
{"time": 1761210555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571184995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "也拿起一块，沾点残余的果酱"}
{"time": 1761211063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569219617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说起来，镇上的菜馆，妈妈有什么推荐的吗？\""}
{"time": 1761211097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084642963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦，原来我没说味道）"}
{"time": 1761211149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960972663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉吃起来蛮好吃的，所以边吃边听"}
{"time": 1761211220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029098802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1571184995]浓度恰到好处，能轻松挂在面包条上。温热的时候甜味尤其具有侵略性，稍微凉下来就能品出树莓深处的些许酸味"}
{"time": 1761211438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044600357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...\"捧着脸颊，\"总感觉比买来的果酱甜很多呢。\""}
{"time": 1761211534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058892269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我是起名苦手）"}
{"time": 1761211558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552129262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "很快吃完了，再拿一条，蘸着果酱吃，一切尽在不言中"}
{"time": 1761211891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393179561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呀……一共就那么三家么，一个是官方扶植的‘衫云栈’，贵，但是也算物有所值。一个是‘老烟囱’，我记得年纪比你们两个都大。还有一个‘松籽暖屋’，这个吃炖菜比较多”"}
{"time": 1761211968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405207975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "吃完一块就停下来，“舒茉的话，去哪一家都行啦。”笑眯眯地看着伊恩，“伊恩带路？”"}
{"time": 1761212013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329239882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看天色"}
{"time": 1761212048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604107849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "天色已经开始染上些暖色了"}
{"time": 1761212119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951250593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个衫云寨有多贵呢”"}
{"time": 1761212164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488914788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“呼...说起来，我是不是该换一下衣服？”思考着，“毕竟这种时候，算是正式场合吗？”咯咯笑"}
{"time": 1761212208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101559459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1951250593]“也看菜嘛，越好的菜溢价越高，普通点的也比其他店贵上两三成”"}
{"time": 1761212349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213953532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来）"}
