{"time": 1761213166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605347355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=916723599]倒是有，但是是两年前买的，现在已经有点穿不下了"}
{"time": 1761213268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073964589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唉...”叹口气，“好啊，那我们现在就去？”"}
{"time": 1761213360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518082647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以啊，阿姨，那我和舒茉就先走了啊，晚上我会把舒茉送回来的”"}
{"time": 1761213412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596826568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（何意.jpg）"}
