{"time": 1761242037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144823382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "绵密浓厚，你一时分不清这是奶油还是棉花糖。是和果酱完全不同的甜味，似乎怎么都不会觉得腻"}
{"time": 1761242073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159658808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吃吗”感觉看舒茉吃东西幸福的表情比自己吃到好吃的还幸福"}
{"time": 1761242091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264351859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（长难句这一块）"}
{"time": 1761242163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518783623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吃...\"毫不吝啬美味的评价，毕竟家里...很少做这种东西...感觉还想再吃一点，但是刚刚都说那种话了...忍住..."}
{"time": 1761242199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604034729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉要是喜欢的话把蛋糕带回去吧，毕竟这算是专门为你点的”"}
{"time": 1761242442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877092303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"摆摆手，不去看蛋糕，生怕流露出渴望的表情，\"算了算了，伊恩赶紧吃吧，味道...很好...\""}
{"time": 1761242518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942093691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拿起舒茉的勺子，舀下一小块，然后放到舒茉的嘴边“这些太多了，我一个人吃不下”"}
{"time": 1761242577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567618481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"不自觉咽了一口口水，\"啊...\"顿时撇过脑袋，\"不要不要...伊恩吃吧。\""}
{"time": 1761242662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1150776074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这一块用的是舒茉的勺子啦，我可以和舒茉用同一个勺子吗”开玩笑的说到"}
{"time": 1761242785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697928345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...那...这块留给我...\"伸出手，掌心朝上，目光看着自己的掌心"}
{"time": 1761242834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486907764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把勺子递给她“还是用勺子吧”"}
{"time": 1761242944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129296229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "接过勺子，暂时不动。\"嗯...剩下的就交给伊恩了。\"在烛火下，静静看着对方"}
{"time": 1761243054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995821701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”小口小口的吃着蛋糕，看着舒茉在看着自己，有点不好意思抬头"}
{"time": 1761243311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781367698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸出勺子递到他嘴巴，\"啊～\""}
{"time": 1761243333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691740203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在干嘛）"}
{"time": 1761243341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135062325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊～”下意识的张开了嘴巴"}
{"time": 1761243359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2090351286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（间接接吻？）"}
{"time": 1761243380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494951118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "塞进他嘴里，起身拍拍衣服，\"准备走吧。\"脸不红心不跳"}
{"time": 1761243470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088316648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后才意识到发生了什么，感觉自己头上已经冒蒸汽了“嗯...嗯..”怔怔的去前台结账，脑内完全无法处理刚刚发生的事情..."}
{"time": 1761243633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33967967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "去饭店的门口，站在门外吹吹风，刚刚的举动自己现在才回过神，使劲拍着自己的脸，\"干了什么啊...\""}
{"time": 1761243691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300449295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该补觉了）"}
{"time": 1761243697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152005501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们可以）"}
{"time": 1761243699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599210298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（自己玩会）"}
{"time": 1761243733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411961025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "结完账去找舒茉,想要说些什么，但话到嘴边就自动咽了回去，什么也说不出来...此时行动应该大于言语...直接牵起舒茉的手"}
{"time": 1761243775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712773612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“直接...回去吗...还是再去看会星星...”抬头看着天空说"}
{"time": 1761243900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795520841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...真是的...都不经过我同意了？”声音很小"}
{"time": 1761243963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91714220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们可以去河边那个小山坡上，那里，视野很好..”"}
{"time": 1761244193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "525004175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哼...小心我跟妈妈告状...就..就说伊恩今天非要牵我一天的手。”故意用干巴巴的语气开口，手却没甩开"}
{"time": 1761244301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "778954355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对...对不起...我感觉刚刚没办法思考了”虽然道歉，但手也没松开"}
{"time": 1761244414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90938625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是的...\"用另一只手拂过耳畔的发丝，\"再继续的话...我该怎么推开你...\"语气里带着些无奈"}
{"time": 1761244532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649506880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在这样...就挺好的，我可以去学木匠，到时候我们一起...”"}
{"time": 1761244543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854123804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（off吧，睡了（）"}
