{"time": 1761268283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616056386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们真的要双元素构筑吗（）"}
{"time": 1761268442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736404675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1649506880]“太平凡了...伊恩，胸中有沟壑...身上有魔法的人，不能受限在这种地方...”事到如今再说这种话连自己都无法说服，“但是...我忍不住想...贪心一点点...” 声音越来越低，母亲的话犹在耳畔。"}
{"time": 1761268461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863171077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（沟壑是？）"}
