{"time": 1761268879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032088478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过也不是完全没苏醒）"}
{"time": 1761268988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545076285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“真的还能奢求更多吗...”小声喃喃，甩甩头，深蓝色的长发在夜空中飞舞，“回去...吗？”"}
{"time": 1761269033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540656343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，也可以吧，毕竟明天还要早起....”"}
{"time": 1761269050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425459012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么叫也可以吧）"}
{"time": 1761269083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574611681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(因为我本来提议和她一起去河边看星星)"}
{"time": 1761269093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507792815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她说想回去了，我说也行吧）"}
{"time": 1761269246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085039649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你为什么不再提议一次（）"}
{"time": 1761269247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179855650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...”轻轻点点头，呼出口气，突然想到了什么，笑了笑，“要送我回家？”"}
{"time": 1761269329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593457865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对啊...走喽”牵着她的手往舒茉家走去"}
{"time": 1761269533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085964943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "路上不至于黑灯瞎火，大部分人家还未熄灯"}
{"time": 1761269565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606368609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟在他身后，另一只手放在自己的脖子上用作焐热，难得没什么想说的，沉默下来。"}
{"time": 1761269600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159917746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（手机砸脸了（）"}
{"time": 1761269659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "957164849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "静静的走着，也没有说什么"}
{"time": 1761270197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859691424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "或许……没有冲动。只要知足，那平和就是一种享受。过多的思绪说不出口，于是恍惚间路就走到了尽头"}
{"time": 1761270332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1353052361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "站在自家门口，望向伊恩"}
{"time": 1761270373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337905889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像到了分别的时间了....”"}
{"time": 1761270468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240186718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明天见，舒茉”恋恋不舍的开口"}
{"time": 1761270553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624330729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...明天见...我在这里送送你。\""}
{"time": 1761270615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "324642506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉可以帮忙取下我衣服吗，昨天拜托阿姨缝的那件....”有些不好意思的说道，感觉好像破坏了气氛"}
{"time": 1761270811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118632066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...好的。\"打开自家的门，去客厅看看"}
{"time": 1761270895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943486587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "当然在后院晾着，能缝的地方都缝了，被扯掉的部分打了补丁，还洗过了，上面的血斑消失无踪"}
{"time": 1761270952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178719244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看爸爸回来了没有，妈妈睡了没有"}
{"time": 1761271140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236328871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "工作间的灯还亮着，舒蕾窝在沙发上织毛衣"}
{"time": 1761271452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771186024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "轻手轻脚地把后院的衣服收下来送回门口，\"伊恩看看...\"等他发表意见"}
{"time": 1761271581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367396423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "接过衣服“帮我谢谢阿姨，阿姨她真厉害啊”"}
{"time": 1761271663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341756800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "得意地抬起台，叉着腰，\"妈妈就是最厉害的，什么都会啦。\""}
{"time": 1761271884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570301874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉也想像妈妈一样...嗯...明天见?\""}
{"time": 1761272175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21670001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，明天见....”"}
{"time": 1761272216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564562904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我发现一件事）"}
{"time": 1761272231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982874526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（上午你把舒茉搬到床上的时候你铺床了吗）"}
{"time": 1761272403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056535872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(他真铺了)"}
{"time": 1761272416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499331393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1761272436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299522873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今晚做好准备哦...该带的东西记得带。\"叮嘱，\"到那边可不能大手大脚花钱。\"目送他离开"}
{"time": 1761272542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588289440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（搬家了不添置新东西吗）"}
{"time": 1761273003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959390278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡着了？）"}
{"time": 1761273115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315040780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "回屋子里，悄悄绕到母亲身后，从后面弯下腰双手搂着她的脖子，\"妈...！出门要带什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1761273308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123286584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我发现你们一没食力二没背景，好像，很难当出头鸟啊）"}
{"time": 1761273428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52066152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诶，那你是不是）"}
{"time": 1761273430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829691330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（芙宁娜）"}
{"time": 1761273474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420669448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1761273488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446398326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是，我也混不成执政啊)"}
{"time": 1761273584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479020242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（意思是有活很难轮得到你们干）"}
{"time": 1761273621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957565938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=959390278]（）"}
{"time": 1761273660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1886610913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1761273665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306871084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有点困  下午吧）"}
{"time": 1761273705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63894132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(马上不就到，午睡的点了)"}
{"time": 1761273716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501333805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(等等午睡呗)"}
{"time": 1761273754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144204867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1315040780]“啊小心针……”她把毛衣针拿远“真是的……舒茉是问出去要带什么，还是问要带什么回来？”"}
{"time": 1761273844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237652306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...都问问？”放开手，小跑到沙发上，坐在她手边靠着。"}
{"time": 1761273875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475103286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=123286584]（所以我说在路上）"}
{"time": 1761273902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499964992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1761273904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744748585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "带着衣服回家了"}
{"time": 1761273913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248398466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（路上也）"}
{"time": 1761273936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847887275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回到家之后烧下水，然后看看病号服干没有"}
{"time": 1761274203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837596083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "今天风大，干了"}
{"time": 1761274380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607912076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等水烧开之后，把火熄灭，用燃料的余温保温着水，然后去还病号服"}
{"time": 1761274422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869997744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1237652306]“要带上的，衣服啦，梳子啦……不好说前线好不好买药，这两天降温快，感冒药可以带一点，然后最重要的是，钱要带够”"}
{"time": 1761274567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764773542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=F23F80FF4052C6808E3B7C4A1BFE8433.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRIgTokBvo_fashd6Jt63QCbVWXkxj95wsg_wooqe7dhuu7kAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQBRav1y0bu8Qh3HRjpZNc3noCPFaCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAISMHV1miMtLxjhoH-pB-qSUMKZS1-IpYoymmWqZ_exdiVfU7OjeRbp7G5_RWgBOWvsIQ,file_size=193533]"}
