{"time": 1761296828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1435855736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=612207493]你感觉有什么在戳你的脸.jpg"}
{"time": 1761296970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623753026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔唔...\"含混不清地呢喃，带着未醒的颤音，\"唔唔...痒...\""}
{"time": 1761297202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946365611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“起床啦小懒虫，还要收拾东西诶”舒蕾的声音"}
{"time": 1761297411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1514581974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...嗯...\"慢慢睁开眼，意识回归的同时看看自己在哪，昨晚好像在沙发上?下意识开口，\"妈...\""}
{"time": 1761297466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985046533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "当然在床上，靠近内侧"}
{"time": 1761297651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359753396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "揉着眼睛坐起来，语气慵懒，\"有妈妈帮的话...舒茉再睡一会...\""}
{"time": 1761297759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248270497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘟嘟，今天我不会帮你哦”戳变成了捏“我会在一旁提醒，东西要你自己收，你才知道放在哪”"}
{"time": 1761297866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220158772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶～\"耷拉的脑袋清醒了一些，\"好吧...\"从床上爬起来，被冷空气激了一下，感觉清醒了不少\"从哪里开始...\""}
{"time": 1761298243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269573772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=248270497]（）"}
{"time": 1761298264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208369525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1220158772]“先刷牙洗脸，然后吃早饭啦”"}
{"time": 1761298449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570344881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...\"去洗漱一下，一边打着哈欠一边照了照镜子，没那么想换直接换好衣服，弄好了就直接坐到餐桌边。"}
{"time": 1761298665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510784129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "今天的早餐是青菜干笋丁胡萝卜馅饼。客厅里点了壁炉，很快让你的身体暖和了起来"}
{"time": 1761298722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "661847911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "母亲帮你准备好了一个小手提皮箱，是之前父亲用来出差的"}
{"time": 1761298728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466505537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在外面中静静的等着，带着舒茉的围巾，倒也没有那么冷"}
{"time": 1761298854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362500398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你的早饭呢）"}
{"time": 1761298919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499217013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "啃点干面包"}
{"time": 1761298967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101060869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有意吃得慢一点，事情临了突然有些害怕，\"嗯...妈...\""}
{"time": 1761299072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81911014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉有些紧张...\"看着小手提包，完全没有这方面经验，\"带什么...\""}
{"time": 1761299234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601590553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“首先肯定是衣服啦，至少会呆两三天吧？不一定有地方洗。冬天的外衣可以不急着换，但是里面穿的要带够”"}
{"time": 1761299302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340579197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“常见的药我收出来了，还有火柴，水瓶……”她报着菜名"}
{"time": 1761299322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080603787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"放下吃了一半的馅饼，急急忙忙去洗手，然后小跑进房间从衣柜里抱出衣服扔在床上，\"三件，嗯...带四件吧。\""}
{"time": 1761299389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804971395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶诶...\"听见妈妈报菜名，\"要带这么多东西吗？\"有点头晕晕"}
{"time": 1761299636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629876736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想生理期）"}
{"time": 1761299939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084710633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1761299981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924469355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是好像有点变态）"}
{"time": 1761300122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830188265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1804971395]“当然要做够准备了，还有”她在桌子上放下一个小瓶子，里面有一团金红色的‘核’漂浮着，在缓缓旋转“这个是，以防万一用的”"}
{"time": 1761300160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706940547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这是什么..?\""}
{"time": 1761300347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560939742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "凑到桌子旁边看看"}
{"time": 1761300361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870536311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“求援信号弹啦，在家里留了好久，总算有一次能带的上了。万一遇到危险了就往地上砸，会有光球飞到天上，这一带的人都认这个”"}
{"time": 1761300436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989854252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"点点头，\"不会用到的啦，我是跟着车队过去。妈妈怎么连这种东西都拿出来了。\"去收拾自己的提包"}
{"time": 1761300477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137380902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不会用到最好了，但是还是带着，又不占什么地方”她塞到你准备出门的衣服口袋里"}
{"time": 1761300834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525390285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"把衣服小心地收好，再往上面盖一层布，把妈妈说的东西小心翼翼地放上去，\"感觉箱子都塞不下了诶。\""}
{"time": 1761300945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1380595940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这哪算多……总比要用的时候不在手边好”她松了口气“反正是坐车嘛”"}
{"time": 1761301125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065777448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯，都听妈妈的。\"脱掉睡衣，换上便于出行的衣服，\"这套衣服上次穿还是在爸爸带我们出去郊游的时候呢...\""}
{"time": 1761301192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727081770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我仔细一想，觉得是)"}
{"time": 1761301217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142253883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……嗯，你爸也嘱咐了一件事”她按着你的肩膀"}
