{"time": 1761302563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306805570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不过听不听好像是客观事实）"}
{"time": 1761302626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470269321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "只能说舒蕾的声音不小"}
{"time": 1761302708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "699921116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1956244379]“总之，要记在心里……女孩子要好好珍惜自己”"}
{"time": 1761302762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803704915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”听到这话脸不由得红了起来，而且现在敲门好像怪怪的，还是继续在外面等着吧"}
{"time": 1761302892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786721702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"低着头，应声，\"舒茉不会...那么随随便便了\""}
{"time": 1761303025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964832312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这种事...就算不说，我也知道的。\"声音有些小，\"嗯嗯...不过爸妈要是担心...为什么还放我出去...?\""}
{"time": 1761303173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669619033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总不能因为担心就把你关在家里吧”她说的理所应当又拿出两个鼓囊的小袋子“还有，这里是300银币，就当给你报销一半。也该培养一下消费观啦”"}
{"time": 1761303824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058036154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈就放心好啦，舒茉都十六岁了。\"伸手接过小袋子，\"虽然...虽然有点害怕...但我这种小事，肯定能处理好的。\""}
{"time": 1761304114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985507030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“十六岁才刚开始呢”她拍拍你的脑袋“时间应该差不多了？”"}
{"time": 1761304232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924130469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘿嘿...\"倒在她怀里，轻轻抱住，站了一会松开手，\"嗯！\"拍拍胸脯，元气满满地开口，像是宣言，\"那舒茉，准备出发！\""}
{"time": 1761304337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729405572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "来回跑几步，给人一种刚来的感觉"}
{"time": 1761304408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393689133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那感觉房子里的人要过聆听了）"}
{"time": 1761304413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875536773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不静步？）"}
{"time": 1761304436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "721397520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这房间隔音这么差？）"}
