{"time": 1761307219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469684118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你知道的，根本想要的东西我是写了的，但是现阶段没觉醒的话。期待的不过是，平静的生活)"}
{"time": 1761307270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1115231023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=530205488]他回头看了看车厢，还说得上空荡，点了点头“一共12银”"}
{"time": 1761307378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734776473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从贴身的口袋里拿出小钱袋，从里面数出十二个银币，\"拜托啦。\""}
{"time": 1761307380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013002869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "上车"}
{"time": 1761307399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779639211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=469684118]（我也平静的生活）"}
{"time": 1761307414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949594142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？怎么是舒茉付钱啦”"}
{"time": 1761307419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410676580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟着一起上车"}
{"time": 1761307552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375338796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"算...\"手指搭在唇边，\"昨天吃饭的谢礼?\"车里找个干净的角落坐下"}
{"time": 1761307581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488387021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "车厢里一共就两个人，都是村里见过的熟面孔"}
{"time": 1761307613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689308333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坐在舒茉身旁，不过毕竟有外人，也不想做些什么"}
{"time": 1761307718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730508877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些好奇另外两人过去的原因，开口询问"}
{"time": 1761307720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1741413581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，少见啊。伊恩舒茉，你们两个应该是，第一次上这趟车？”说这话的是村里钟表店的老板，看起来30岁上下，穿着修身的马甲，外套披在肩膀上"}
{"time": 1761307736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795795230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（嘻嘻）"}
{"time": 1761307752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1926670783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我们想去前线参观参观”"}
{"time": 1761307756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323606828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1689308333]（没有就想了？）"}
{"time": 1761307769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "715476725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没有起码可以牵牵手啊）"}
{"time": 1761307802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209056312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"早上好！\"活力满满地回答，\"妈妈让我出去长长见识。\""}
{"time": 1761307844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418665631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我要是说钟表匠叫米沙）"}
{"time": 1761307854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476431119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(不是米哈伊尔？"}
{"time": 1761308092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "829084046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大叔过去是做什么?嗯...让舒茉猜猜，有人委托您过去修理吗？\""}
{"time": 1761308107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228869513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像年龄设计低了）"}
{"time": 1761308110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718934274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（40吧（）"}
{"time": 1761308260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472802219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呀，那倒不是，我这趟没带工具，只带了酒，嚯嚯……我是去和老战友聚聚嘛”*他从包里拿出一瓶褐色的液体，里头似乎还泡了点药材“说起来舒蕾没有跟着一起啊，也好也好……出去玩的话有时候父母在旁边会扫兴吧，她也是放的下心……不过也不是什么危险的地方。当年我还在那边的时候才算动荡”"}
{"time": 1761308313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378846743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大叔可以讲讲年轻时候的故事吗，我很感兴趣”有些期待的看着他"}
{"time": 1761308374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302901861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈要是跟着我也很开心啦。\"摇摇头，\"没有妈妈一起...总感觉自己不太行。\"有些腼腆的笑"}
{"time": 1761308714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1798179523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "等了一阵也没更多人来，车轮就在他的讲述声中转动起来。\n“那时候埃尔文还不叫前线，只是个村子，和白未村也没什么区别。精灵和人类还有来往，现在是格兰之森的地方还有一部分当年也是人类的活动范围，偶尔还能见得到精灵”"}
{"time": 1761308803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202558489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大叔见过精灵吗”"}
{"time": 1761308828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550312980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，精灵吗？\"有点感兴趣"}
{"time": 1761308965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734680614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“倒是见过一位，不过不是洛兰之森里的。你们也知道嘛，大概三十年前——应该是我12岁那年，森林里起了场大火，从那以后精灵销声匿迹，魔物也陆续出现”"}
{"time": 1761308997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531409188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...我也想见一见精灵呢\""}
{"time": 1761309010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443946341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那之前我没见过精灵，不过这事传到赫顿玛尔之后，那边派来支援的人手里有一位，不过好像是她自己要求来的？”"}
{"time": 1761309032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658938511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我不太清楚，也就远远地见过一次”"}
{"time": 1761309108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423786099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，如果有机会就好了。\"叹口气"}
{"time": 1761309133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72824707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...不过听说精灵是天生的魔法种族呢。\""}
{"time": 1761309171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599736646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"天生就会魔法吗？\""}
{"time": 1761309229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063903040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是真的，想来过去的历史中，洛兰之森能够安定就是他们在出力吧”"}
{"time": 1761309384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100960675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，我也想见一见啦，这种神秘的种族。\"呼出口气，饶有兴趣看向窗外的风景"}
{"time": 1761309434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392972866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“后来，我18岁那年……那时候防线已经退到埃尔文了。我跟几个同龄主动去的前线”"}
{"time": 1761309610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462798053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“后面情况就慢慢稳定下来了，魔物虽然可怕，但在源源不断的支援和指挥官的领导下，那些只有蛮力和本能的魔物构不成威胁。后来那些会魔法的怪物也见得少了，那些支援的正规军也慢慢回去了”"}
{"time": 1761309651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1190264231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也就是说现在的前线很安全咯?\""}
{"time": 1761309771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588120472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，保持警惕的话，是这样没错”*他点点头"}
{"time": 1761309786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796976372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那倒是没问题啦。\"打个哈欠，想要补个觉"}
{"time": 1761309922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867592035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "靠着车厢的角落，轻轻闭上眼。"}
{"time": 1761310301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751758827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥又哪去了)"}
{"time": 1761310308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215817282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1761310318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442224056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我刚刚想打字）"}
{"time": 1761310339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480230871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（打一半然后和以前室友聊了几句话）"}
{"time": 1761310346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489343833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后就忽然失忆了）"}
{"time": 1761310373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269623263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1867592035][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “车厢很硬吧，要不靠在我的肩膀上好了”"}
{"time": 1761310384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958603224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我看你压力优化很开心啊)"}
