{"time": 1761331645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1991136821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总之和舒茉往树林密集的地方跑，希望不要被找到"}
