{"time": 1761332065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429390558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "马车加起速来，马匹和马夫从未如此意见统一过"}
{"time": 1761332080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504518942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事...\"边跑边回头盯着那个发红光的车厢，\"我们快点走....\""}
{"time": 1761332090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310608895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "而商道两侧植被本就不算茂密，你们跑的速度更说不上快"}
