{"time": 1761333022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998889153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "身上泛起鸡皮疙瘩，\"啊...啊...\"但是它现在还没有出来，勉强还维持着冷静，用尽全力奔跑"}
{"time": 1761333066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557080205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我们一起..”但是已经做好了怪物追上来断后的准备"}
