{"time": 1761334253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1559844026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "松了口气，\"伊恩，看样子我们应该跑得掉...\""}
{"time": 1761334272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1253843235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”松了口气“不过...还不能放松，希望魔物只有那一只..”"}
{"time": 1761334503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230857792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "附近植被不算茂密，也许还够身材娇小的你们躲起来。但这里离村子和前哨站都不近"}
{"time": 1761334628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689225851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"事到如今，我们只能往前走了...\"事出紧急，箱子好像丢在了马车上，摸了摸自己身上的东西...下定决心把信号弹摸出来。"}
{"time": 1761334649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081864228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "本来就塞在你的衣服口袋里"}
