{"time": 1761334667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485908127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "出发前，舒蕾把它放在你今天要穿的衣服里了"}
{"time": 1761334684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413935809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以为什么要跳下来而不是全车夫哈压库）"}
{"time": 1761334685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526027065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉知道该怎么走吗”"}
