{"time": 1761358853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078023178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....”有些恍惚，感觉意识随时会消散"}
{"time": 1761358880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099870034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "希望那家伙清醒后不会再追上来了"}
{"time": 1761358915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283202454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉.....很厉害呢,多亏了舒茉...救了我”"}
{"time": 1761359035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179733811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1761359038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589667828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我...我厉害在哪?\"有些着急，\"别说话...留着力气。\"自己明明什么都没做到...\"我带伊恩离开...\""}
{"time": 1761359043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424204062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(别急，打字)"}
{"time": 1761359047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514218675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1761359236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681766722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉...要不把我留在这吧，我..这样..只会成为...你的拖累”"}
{"time": 1761359287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733428515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不行...!\"很像捂住他的嘴，但现在不能做这种事，\"别说话!留着力气。\"语气不容置疑"}
{"time": 1761359395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210324711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "然而天不遂人愿。后方传来扎耳的喘气声和肢体在沙石上摩擦的声音。他似乎正在站起来"}
{"time": 1761359401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848366817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头“我已经...有点..走不动了...”血仍然还在不断的流着，脸色愈来愈白"}
{"time": 1761359443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349717202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到声音更是下定了决心“舒茉...你快走吧，带着我，只会....一起死”"}
{"time": 1761359526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777485394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（假如我每回合流血掉一的话，我是不是差不多就剩10点血了（））"}
{"time": 1761359569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352636865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "前方似乎也有什么在靠近。似乎是脚步声，一深一浅的"}
{"time": 1761359627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674529155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "希望不要是魔物...如果是魔物的话，舒茉大概率也很难走掉了"}
{"time": 1761359662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598563130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"没有放手的打算，虽然心知这不过是...自己一意孤行，\"对不起...但就算把伊恩留在这里，那头怪物也会追上我，所以...\"执着地带着伊恩继续往前走，深吸一口气，大喊，\"有人吗？救命啊!\""}
{"time": 1761359743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091301698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要推开舒茉，但大概连这样的力气都没有了，无奈的叹口气，希望前面的会是救兵..."}
{"time": 1761360082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792119041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2091301698]你的身体阵阵发虚，失血太多了，你有些喘不过气，但偏偏吊着没有晕过去。有什么在压榨你的意识来给身体充能"}
{"time": 1761360177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351393314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "只能寄希望于散开的雾气可以挡住身后的怪物和面前的脚步的主人是人类这件事了，一边求救一边拖着伊恩。"}
{"time": 1761360236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502438235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "尽量走的稍微快一点点，不能在让舒茉陷入险境了"}
{"time": 1761360380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132920123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "前方的东西拨开最后的灌木……那是一杆随处可见的烧火棍，而持握着它的人则是……钟表匠。他看起来火急火燎，一脚深一脚浅地往你们这边赶来"}
{"time": 1761360472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "603563058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "太好了，松了一口气...这样的话，舒茉大概就安全了吧...."}
{"time": 1761360571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710130428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"米哈伊尔大叔...\"绷紧的心神刚准备放松，想到那夸张的战斗力，不由得再次紧绷，\"小心，那是个怪物...我们得快点走。\""}
{"time": 1761360585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179789858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(咦，我突然想到成为弓箭手的理由了)"}
{"time": 1761360598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396650526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1761360611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788946726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这不就是，如我所书变成了不知哪来的弓?)"}
{"time": 1761360618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001790257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（气笑了）"}
{"time": 1761360753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172626240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“卡赞症……”你们听见他嘀咕，他随后大喊“趴下！”"}
{"time": 1761360798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800540725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "本来也没什么站着的力气了，直接瘫倒在了地上"}
{"time": 1761360943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727352467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "听从他的话趴下来"}
{"time": 1761361054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968372862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "背后的脚步不知什么时候已经到了近前。米哈伊尔双手分握在棍中和棍尾，用的却是枪法。力从地起，直直刺出"}
