{"time": 1761367967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150904964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "往水的深处游，看能不能寻得什么"}
{"time": 1761368027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492893752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "越往下，就越是厚重粘稠。你感到阵阵窒息"}
{"time": 1761368131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960459956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好难受.. 还是浮上水面吧，周围看着什么都没有的样子，还有讨厌的血腥味...想离开这里了"}
{"time": 1761368200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1574567104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "闭上眼睛，等救援地时候睡了过去"}
{"time": 1761368256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924650385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你上浮，似乎还有别的助力。探出水面后你没有停止，而是继续上升。“他们”发出不甘的叹息，你能听见，但你们彼此都无能为力"}
{"time": 1761368309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1298765949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "飞...飞起来了，看看视野中，除了水还有什么"}
