{"time": 1761394740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699686453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（赛丽亚不知道.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761394751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133115568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...似乎可以把讨厌的人定住...我也不太清楚怎么放出来的。\""}
{"time": 1761394763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075233389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=736276386](那肯定不提啊)"}
{"time": 1761394784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874542649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还能...用一些雾的力量?舒茉不清楚...\""}
{"time": 1761394927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697344119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=329813771]“这话应该换我来说，多亏了舒茉..我才能活下去”"}
{"time": 1761395103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962002010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……突然获得的力量？”赛丽亚有点没料到你会在这个时候问这个“很少见的情况诶”"}
{"time": 1761395196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821819079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯....突然就...自己可以放出来...\"更主要的细节决定隐瞒下来，\"赛丽亚姐姐，我这是...怎么了?\""}
{"time": 1761395262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258576795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉有点开心，这样的话，舒茉就没有理由和自己分开了...."}
{"time": 1761395466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593063195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然少见……但也不是没有先例。大陆上偶尔会有人后天觉醒特殊的力量。契机因人而异……有的是和血脉有关，有的是被什么更超然的存在注视或者赐福”"}
{"time": 1761395505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922438635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...那赛丽亚小姐知道我身上是什么原因吗？\""}
{"time": 1761395565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122448117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她摇摇头“我只是知道有这种事，但是我并不会魔法，也看不出来”"}
{"time": 1761395749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172817814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...伊恩，你身体好些了吗？\""}
{"time": 1761395926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1389777065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "隐隐作痛.jpg"}
{"time": 1761395929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858221656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但是隐隐"}
{"time": 1761396159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836510094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像好了不少了...不怎么疼了，好神奇，明明那么严重的伤，没想到居然好的这么快”"}
{"time": 1761396250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742613240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉呢..你感觉怎么样了”"}
{"time": 1761396266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633430844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"摸着小肚子，揉一揉"}
{"time": 1761396723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962273621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉以后打算做什么呢”唐突提问，实在是不想和她分开"}
{"time": 1761396903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555982192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...就算这么问，现在我也没什么想法...好突然...\""}
{"time": 1761396967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081541397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“因为舒茉....已经不“普通”了吧”虽然自己从来没有觉得舒茉普通过，不过舒茉自己倒是这样说过"}
{"time": 1761397134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363919629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"一时之间完全不知道该说什么，\"舒茉....舒茉真的不普通吗？都是...日记本的功劳...\""}
{"time": 1761397195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667728143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是日记本是舒茉的，日记本的力量不就是舒茉的力量吗...”"}
{"time": 1761397498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96016782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不能算吧...其他人拿着...也会有一样的力量。\"想到这种可能也说了出来，有些失落感"}
{"time": 1761397540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525868860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉可以把日记本借给我一下吗..”"}
{"time": 1761397866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1499745104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在散步）"}
{"time": 1761398478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203834117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1525868860]\"嗯...\"把怀里的日记本递给伊恩"}
{"time": 1761398515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650641542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"那股力量是怎么用的呢？\"感受日记本的魔力，试图调动"}
{"time": 1761398644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522707189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你能感觉到日记本中有朦胧的魔力，但是无法交互"}
{"time": 1761398717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140504887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么样?伊恩。\""}
{"time": 1761398791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530308068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头，但是很开心\"不行...看样子这股魔力只有舒茉可以使用啦，所以舒茉一点也不普通\""}
{"time": 1761399331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016636825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只有我?\"摇摇手，\"不可能不可能...伊恩都能感觉到魔力...所以肯定不是我特别啦...\"自己说出来感觉没什么说服力"}
{"time": 1761399688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675199145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了舒茉....这肯定算是你的力量啦，除非你打算不要这本日记，而且本身能调动魔力就已经不是普通人了...”"}
{"time": 1761400160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577019186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=675199145]\"不对吧...伊恩不要说这种话...普通人...舒茉怎么可能不是...\"一直以为的世界观有种崩塌的感觉，一时陷入了混乱，语无伦次"}
{"time": 1761400415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844788977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉要重新规划一下自己的未来了.”"}
{"time": 1761400496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179427594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉如果认为自己是普通人的话...那我应该也是了”"}
{"time": 1761400592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049403626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊啊...我搞不懂啦。\"捂着脑袋，\"伊恩就算这么说...舒茉也完全不明白。\""}
{"time": 1761400855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082001705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉也该想想之前对我说的话了..最终籍籍无名，一辈子在这种小村子里.....”"}
{"time": 1761401113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609620092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1082001705]没想到这种时候回旋镖打在自己身上，\"呃...\"低下头，自己也没有做过相应的规划，\"对不起...我没想过...现在要去做什么...\""}
{"time": 1761401184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668280354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好啦..时间还很长不是么...至于现在的话，还是在养养伤吧..舒茉要是无聊的话，我们出去逛逛？”"}
{"time": 1761401597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717330207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...不对...现在应该休息吧...\""}
{"time": 1761401624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928810958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就...休息吧...”"}
{"time": 1761401635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373858157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看赛丽亚还在吗"}
{"time": 1761401848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499554594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还在啊）"}
{"time": 1761402176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902726869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...伊恩，今天就好好休息吧...\"看向赛丽亚，\"赛丽亚小姐能帮我联系一下妈妈吗？让她不要担心...\""}
{"time": 1761402729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803987410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...好吧，先好好养伤”"}
{"time": 1761406348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644667281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=902726869]“嗯，我也打算这么做。舒茉觉得怎么说比较好？”"}
{"time": 1761406460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330620023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"顺利到达了前线...路上也没有发生什么，妈妈不用担心。\"斟酌着开口，\"这么说就好了...赛丽亚姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1761406486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593696987", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，万一阿姨也看到了信号弹....”"}
